  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the UI Now**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in designing the UI components based on the provided layout image and frontend design instructions. The initial focus is the header, specifically the app logo which I envision as a building or blueprint. My aim is to perfectly replicate the visuals.\n\n\n**Refining the Header Structure**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the header elements. The project title and status will be editable inline with a pencil icon. I\'ve decided on \"Selamat datang, Adjie \360\237\221\213\", \"Gedung USC\" for the title, and a subtitle explaining the function. I\'m also including project summary badges for name, floor count (editable), and date. The top right will feature notification and user avatar icons. Lastly, I\'m incorporating action buttons for new projects, saving, and exporting to Excel.\n\n\n**Constructing the Work List**\n\nI\'m now building out the \"Daftar Pekerjaan & Volume\" section. I\'ve got the category filter pills figured out (\"Semua\", \"Persiapan Dll,\" etc.), and the search input is in place. I\'m focusing on the floor-grouped accordion structure with expandable sections for each floor and a \"Umum & Pondasi\" section. The table is next, with the specified columns (No, Pekerjaan, Kategori, Parameter, Satuan, Volume, Status, Aksi) all planned out. I\'m imagining colored badges for \"Kategori\" and status indicators.\n\n\n**Analyzing Project Summaries**\n\nI\'m now integrating the \"Ringkasan Proyek\" card, focusing on the graphic illustration, project details, and the \"Ekspor Excel\" button. I\'m also planning the bottom \"Rekap Total Volume (Bangunan)\" section with its four distinct cards. The left sidebar is also in progress with its logo, menu items, and the \"Tips\" card. Finally, the AI Assistant Modal with file upload, parameter verification, and approval mechanism is being worked on.\n\n\n**Defining Modal Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing the modals: the \"Masukkan ke Kalkulator\" button triggers item detail, allowing step-by-step math, source references, and inline editing. I\'m also planning the Add/Edit Work Item modal (catalog selection/custom entries), Floor Management modal (add/rename/remove floors), and the Project Management modal (listing projects, switching, renaming, deleting). I\'m planning out the components structure and file system, to create a modular design system.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2354253"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  LayoutDashboard,\\n  FolderKanban,\\n  Layers,\\n  Calculator,\\n  FileSpreadsheet,\\n  Download,\\n  Lightbulb,\\n  Sparkles,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\nexport type NavTab = \'dashboard\' | \'proyek\' | \'lantai\' | \'kalkulator\' | \'rekap\' | \'ai\' | \'ekspor\';\\n\\ninterface SidebarProps {\\n  activeTab: NavTab;\\n  onSelectTab: (tab: NavTab) => void;\\n  onOpenAI: () => void;\\n  onExportExcel: () => void;\\n  onOpenFloors: () => void;\\n  onOpenProjects: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Sidebar: React.FC<SidebarProps> = ({\\n  activeTab,\\n  onSelectTab,\\n  onOpenAI,\\n  onExportExcel,\\n  onOpenFloors,\\n  onOpenProjects,\\n}) => {\\n  const navItems = [\\n    { id: \'dashboard\' as NavTab, label: \'Beranda\', icon: LayoutDashboard },\\n    { id: \'proyek\' as NavTab, label: \'Proyek\', icon: FolderKanban, action: onOpenProjects },\\n    { id: \'lantai\' as NavTab, label: \'Lantai\', icon: Layers, action: onOpenFloors },\\n    { id: \'kalkulator\' as NavTab, label: \'Pekerjaan\', icon: Calculator },\\n    { id: \'rekap\' as NavTab, label: \'Hasil Volume\', icon: FileSpreadsheet },\\n    { id: \'ai\' as NavTab, label: \'Asisten AI\', icon: Sparkles, action: onOpenAI },\\n    { id: \'ekspor\' as NavTab, label: \'Ekspor Excel\', icon: Download, action: onExportExcel },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <aside className=\\\"w-64 bg-white border-r border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0 h-screen sticky top-0\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        {/* Brand Header */}\\n        <div className=\\\"px-6 py-5 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-blue-700 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold shadow-sm\\\">\\n            <svg\\n              className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\"\\n              viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"\\n              fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n              stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\"\\n              strokeWidth=\\\"2\\\"\\n              strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n              strokeLinejoin=\\\"round\\\"\\n            >\\n              <rect x=\\\"4\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\" ry=\\\"2\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M9 22v-4h6v4\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M8 6h.01\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M16 6h.01\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M8 10h.01\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M16 10h.01\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M8 14h.01\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M16 14h.01\\\" />\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <h1 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight\\\">Kalkulator Volume</h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium\\\">RuangRAB Konstruksi</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Navigation Items */}\\n        <nav className=\\\"p-3 space-y-1\\\">\\n          {navItems.map((item) => {\\n            const Icon = item.icon;\\n            const isActive = activeTab === item.id;\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={item.id}\\n                onClick={() => {\\n                  onSelectTab(item.id);\\n                  if (item.action) item.action();\\n                }}\\n                className={`w-full flex items-center gap-3 px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition-all ${\\n                  isActive\\n                    ? \'bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 font-semibold\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-50\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <Icon className={`w-4 h-4 ${isActive ? \'text-blue-600\' : \'text-slate-400\'}`} />\\n                <span className=\\\"truncate\\\">{item.label}</span>\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </nav>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Bottom Tips Widget */}\\n      <div className=\\\"p-4 m-3 b