  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Recap Cards**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the recap summary cards in `src/components/RecapCards.tsx`. Currently, I\'m working with the mockup. I\'ve noted the header as \"Rekap Total Volume (Bangunan)\" and need to create four cards: Volume Beton (with a cube icon and an example value like `125,40 m\302\263`), Luas Pekerjaan (with an area icon and an example of `1.240,50 m\302\262`), and two more cards with their data which I will figure out shortly.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
