  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Model Availability**\n\nI\'m currently observing an issue with the gemini-3.8-flash model; it\'s showing a 503 error, indicating high demand. I\'m noting the unavailability for future reference. I\'m now testing gemini-3.1- to assess if other models are impacted or still available.\n\n\n**Confirming Fallback Success**\n\nI\'ve confirmed that the fallback mechanism to `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` works as expected, successfully extracting data after the primary model experienced a 503 error. The process reproduced the user\'s observed outcome precisely. Now, I\'m reviewing the user\'s prompt, specifically section A, to ensure all retry and fallback requirements are meticulously addressed and implemented for robustness.\n\n\n**Implementing User Feedback**\n\nI\'m now integrating the user feedback regarding error handling. I\'ll display a user-friendly error message, incorporating a \"Coba Lagi\" button in the UI. I\'ll also implement a mechanism to prevent duplicate requests from accidental double-clicks, disabling interaction during processing. I\'m focusing on ensuring a smooth and responsive user experience.\n\n\n**Defining Feature Implementation**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Unggah Dokumen\" and \"Tombol Analisis\" features. I\'m focusing on file type validation (PDF, JPG, JPEG, PNG, max 15MB) and displaying the file name, size, and upload status. The \"Mulai Analisis AI\" button will activate only when a document and settings are available. Next, I will shift focus to Section C, the Dimension and Scale Reading Rules.\n\n\n**Refining Unit Conversion**\n\nI\'m now implementing the update to automatically convert units on the front end without re-calling Gemini after the analysis is complete, as suggested. I\'m focusing on maintaining the original dimension number and updating the conversion value based on user selection, storing both original and converted values. I\'m also planning to extract data from PDF\'s and Images.\n\n\n**Structuring Data for Display**\n\nI\'m now focusing on structuring the AI output into a user-friendly interactive table as a part of Section E. I\'m incorporating fields for \"Parameter\", \"Nilai Terbaca\", \"Satuan\", \"Hasil Konversi\", \"Sumber / Lokasi\", \"Status\", and \"Aksi\". I\'m also ensuring the table allows users to edit \"Nilai Terbaca\" and \"Hasil Konversi\" values, providing flexibility and control over the data.\n\n\n**Integrating Calculator Link**\n\nI\'m now integrating the data output into a calculator. I\'ve added a button \"Masukkan ke Kalkulator (X Parameter Disetujui)\" for seamless integration, and I\'m updating the parameters in the target floor for calculation. The system will automatically recalculate the deterministic volume and present a preview/success message. I\'ve also implemented the option for users to select parameters via checkboxes, and buttons to approve (Green) and reject (Red) parameters. Furthermore, there\'s a dropdown for mapping parameters to specific tasks like \"Building Width\" to \"Land Clearing -> Width\" or \"Brick Wall -> Length\".\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_188790"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \'\\nconst fs = require(\\\"fs\\\");\\nconst { GoogleGenAI, Type } = require(\\\"@google/genai\\\");\\nrequire(\\\"dotenv\\\").config();\\n\\nasync function testExtraction() {\\n  const ai = new GoogleGenAI({\\n    apiKey: process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY,\\n    httpOptions: { headers: { \\\"User-Agent\\\": \\\"aistudio-build\\\" } }\\n  });\\n  const pdfBytes = fs.readFileSync(\\\"public/assets/aistudio/rencana_1-Model_2ceb7bed.pdf\\\");\\n  const base64 = pdfBytes.toString(\\\"base64\\\");\\n\\n  const systemInstruction = `\\nAnda adalah Senior Civil Engineering Quantity Surveyor RuangRAB.\\nTugas Anda membaca gambar teknik denah/potongan konstruksi (PDF/gambar) dan mengekstrak dimensi serta parameter kuantitas pekerjaan secara akurat.\\n\\nATURAN UTAMA:\\n1. Baca angka dimensi yang tertulis pada gambar (misal 600, 300, 150, 1270, 200, 170, 100, 37).\\n2. Simpan nilai angka asli pada field \\\"rawExtractedValue\\\" (contoh: 600, 300, 1270). JANGAN mengalikan angka tertulis dengan faktor skala!\\n3. Jika pada gambar angka tertulis tanpa satuan eksplisit, gunakan satuan yang ditentukan pengguna (misal cm).\\n4. Catat lokasi grid / notasi as (contoh: \\\"As A-D\\\", \\\"As 1-9\\\", \\\"Ruang Tamu As 6-8\\\", \\\"KM/WC As 4-5\\\").\\n5. Identifikasi nama ruang, elevasi lantai, dan usulan pekerjaan RuangRAB yang relevan.\\n6. Kembalikan JSON terstruktur sesuai responseSchema.\\n`;\\n\\n  try {\\n    const res = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n      model: \\\"gemini-3.1-flash-lite\\\",\\n      contents: {\\n        parts: [\\n          { inlineData: { mimeType: \\\"application/pdf\\\", data: base64 } },\\n          { text: \\\"Analisis denah ini (satuan default pengguna: cm, skala: 1:100, lantai: Lantai 1). Ekstrak dimensi bangunan total (panjang, lebar), dimensi ruang-ruang, dan elemen arsitektur/struktur yang tertera.\\\" }\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      config: {\\n        systemInstruction,\\n        responseMimeType: \\\"application/json\\\",\\n        responseSchema: {\\n          type: Type.OBJECT,\\n          properties: {\\n            documentSummary: { type: Type.STRING },\\n            identifiedFloor: { type: Type.STRING },\\n            identifiedScale: { type: Type.STRING },\\n            items: {\\n              type: Type.ARRAY,\\n              items: {\\n                type: Type.OBJECT,\\n                properties: {\\n                  targetCategory: { type: Type.STRING },\\n                  suggestedWorkName: { type: Type.STRING },\\n                  parameterName: { type: Type.STRING },\\n                  rawExtractedValue: { type: Type.NUMBER },\\n                  detectedUnit: { type: Type.STRING },\\n                  confidence: { type: Type.NUMBER },\\n                  pageOrLocation: { type: Type.STRING },\\n                  notes: { type: Type.STRING }\\n                },\\n                required: [\\\"targetCategory\\\", \\\"suggestedWorkName\\\", \\\"parameterName\\\", \\\"rawExtractedValue\\\"]\\n              }\\n            }\\n          },\\n          required: [\\\"documentSummary\\\", \\\"items\\\"]\\n        }\\n      }\\n    });\\n    console.log(\\\"Extraction Result successfully parsed!\\\");\\n    const parsed = JSON.parse(res.text);\\n    console.log(\\\"Summary:\\\", parsed.documentSummary);\\n    console.log(\\\"Floor:\\\", parsed.identifiedFloor, \\\"Scale:\\\", parsed.identifiedScale);\\n    console.log(\\\"Extracted items count:\\\", parsed.items.length);\\n    console.log(\\\"First 5 items:\\\", JSON.stringify(parsed.items.slice(0, 5), null, 2));\\n  } catch (err) {\\n    console.error(\\\"Test failed:\\\", err.message);\\n  }\\n}\\ntestExtraction();\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"IsDaemon\":false, \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":15000, \"toolAction\":\"Testing structured PDF extraction on sample drawing\", \"toolSummary\":\"Test structured PDF extraction\"}"
