  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating the Interface**\n\nI am currently working on updating `src/components/AddWorkModal.tsx`. I\'m focusing on implementing the new subtitle, which will read: \"Pilih pekerjaan dari katalog atau tambahkan pekerjaan baru.\" I also need to make sure the tab label accurately displays \"Katalog Pekerjaan\" along with the correct item count. I am following Section F and referencing the screenshot `image_2dbae6ee.png`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
