  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Testing the Endpoint**\n\nI\'m currently testing the `http://localhost:3000/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` endpoint using a `curl` request. I\'m focusing on validating the retry and fallback mechanisms by sending the `public/assets/aistudio/rencana_1-Model_2ceb7bed.pdf` file. This direct test should reveal the endpoint\'s robustness.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_267951"
      name: "run_command"
      arguments_json: "{\"CommandLine\":\"node -e \'\\nconst fs = require(\\\"fs\\\");\\nconst http = require(\\\"http\\\");\\n\\nasync function testApi() {\\n  const pdfBytes = fs.readFileSync(\\\"public/assets/aistudio/rencana_1-Model_2ceb7bed.pdf\\\");\\n  const base64 = pdfBytes.toString(\\\"base64\\\");\\n  const payload = JSON.stringify({\\n    fileBase64: base64,\\n    mimeType: \\\"application/pdf\\\",\\n    fileName: \\\"rencana_1-Model.pdf\\\",\\n    floorName: \\\"Lantai 1\\\",\\n    unitSetting: \\\"cm\\\",\\n    scaleSetting: \\\"1:100\\\"\\n  });\\n\\n  const req = http.request(\\\"http://localhost:3000/api/gemini/extract-dimensions\\\", {\\n    method: \\\"POST\\\",\\n    headers: {\\n      \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\",\\n      \\\"Content-Length\\\": Buffer.byteLength(payload)\\n    }\\n  }, (res) => {\\n    let body = \\\"\\\";\\n    res.on(\\\"data\\\", chunk => body += chunk);\\n    res.on(\\\"end\\\", () => {\\n      console.log(\\\"Status code:\\\", res.statusCode);\\n      try {\\n        const json = JSON.parse(body);\\n        console.log(\\\"Success:\\\", json.success, \\\"Model used:\\\", json.modelUsed);\\n        if (json.data) {\\n          console.log(\\\"Summary:\\\", json.data.documentSummary);\\n          console.log(\\\"Identified floor:\\\", json.data.identifiedFloor);\\n          console.log(\\\"Items count:\\\", json.data.items?.length);\\n          console.log(\\\"First item:\\\", json.data.items?.[0]);\\n        } else {\\n          console.log(\\\"Error response:\\\", json);\\n        }\\n      } catch (e) {\\n        console.log(\\\"Raw body:\\\", body.slice(0, 300));\\n      }\\n    });\\n  });\\n\\n  req.on(\\\"error\\\", (e) => console.error(\\\"Req error:\\\", e));\\n  req.write(payload);\\n  req.end();\\n}\\ntestApi();\\n\'\", \"Cwd\":\"/app/applet\", \"IsDaemon\":false, \"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":15000, \"toolAction\":\"Testing extract-dimensions API end-to-end\", \"toolSummary\":\"Test extract-dimensions API\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\257\003\n\254\003\001i\024}\023l\032\366]\273<\210 \031:3\354\343\024\213\004\034\204\024\373PM\356|\276\234\261\031\006\256\323\221\r\303\213\272\025\325\201\231\247\244\303`\240\306#x\377#\033W\277\"\f\267\321,\274.\017\303\025U\340\'\202\242O\003\032\230\306I\217\273\357\363o\f*\313jb\243E\236\230}-\256\370\304\216\227\330\227\323\226\361\030\345#\017\334\t\257\316\306\240\033d\313J\266R\215\241\317\217$0Y3o\332J\021N\204\220O\363\"\033\364\b\354Q\314458\202\322/\357\326\336\236 #76\345[\321\346(\334\336\330\002U\327\027\255\320\326\216\017\320\266\214:\a|\350!\253\246\263\354\360\217\034\\\206s\266\205o\032\235\032\vV|\245$\3463\321\316\\g,EM\315\320\213\031\341\314\211o\311/\312\3510\354\211\210L\274&\253\335\233x\231\232\242\354\375s{\374#F?H\030\227\262\266\337\211r,\276\231h\030\230]C\304\250\252\374\2011\207\266\206\032\360}\327\003\354ZB\207\336\302\207uY\361:\270\342\031\362{\212\036\343\222\207\231\202-\223\232\302\357R\210\235 \004\314\247\212\354\330\f4\347\017+O\233\030\366A\365\367\246\037\233Q\200\203\310\364\263$\027\024\337_\230\216\020\304\231N\275\\\351\037.\260y\332\n7\254\277\242\360\220\237\301\004\332\360i(\253\355\334v\277\270\364\r\207_\260+[\215\275\302rQ\215\364\332\324\'\305\263\253m\b\221f\301\325{\273\"\246\243\022\257\316\210F\317\335ya$\370\357L!\217\275\321t-\273k"
