  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Requirements**\n\nI\'m meticulously dissecting the user\'s requirements to ensure a comprehensive and bug-free implementation. I\'m focusing on the \"SIDEBAR BUKA-TUTUP RESPONSIF\" aspect, particularly the collapsible sidebar on both desktop and mobile. Right now I\'m paying close attention to the desktop behavior with the sidebar open and closed.\n\n\n**Refining Sidebar Functionality**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the mobile implementation. The sidebar should be hidden by default on mobile, opening as an overlay drawer with a backdrop and close button. I need to make the content expand appropriately when the sidebar is closed. Smooth transitions are key, aiming for around 200ms. I must also remember to persist the sidebar\'s collapsed state in `localStorage` and ensure all menus and action buttons remain fully functional and visible, especially in tables.\n\n\n**Designing Confirmation Dialogs**\n\nI\'m focusing now on custom UI confirmation modals for job, floor, and template deletions, as well as project resets. Specifically for the work calculator, I\'m integrating \'Edit\' and \'Delete\' buttons directly into the `WorkTable`, plus approval/rejection for AI drafts. Deletion necessitates a clear confirmation modal, and I\'ll ensure deleted items are removed only from the active project, not from catalog templates. I\'ll update the total, volume, and `localStorage` to reflect these changes. I will also make sure rejected draft keys are correctly added to avoid re-creation without approval.\n\n\n**Implementing Catalog Features**\n\nI\'m now implementing the ability to hide items from the catalog and provide a filter to reactivate them. I\'m storing `disabledCatalogIds` in `localStorage` for this. I will also save custom user-created jobs in `customCatalogItems` for reuse. I\'m focusing on the warning message for items in active use and preventing the silent deletion of project data.\n\n\n**Evaluating AI Outputs**\n\nI\'m now focused on how Gemini analyzes images, specifically identifying elements like dimensions, grid locations, and architectural features. Then, I cross-reference these findings with my catalog of work items, matching based on the catalog ID, category, element type, and required parameters to ensure the creation of relevant jobs. I need to be sure to only generate work supported by visual evidence, and I need to avoid adding the entire catalog.\n\n\n**Generating Job Recommendations**\n\nI\'m now generating job recommendations based on floor plans that may have missing information. If a detail like wall height is missing, I\'ll flag it as \"Incomplete.\" For the main floor, I\'m specifying 60x60 homogeneous tile installation (`ars-homogenous-tile-60x60`), using the `luas_lantai` parameter. Bathroom/toilet requires 40x40 anti-slip floor tiles (`ars-keramik-toilet-antislip`). Identified doors and windows will be categorized as P1/P2 doors or windows.\n\n\n**Refining AI Parameter Handling**\n\nI\'m now focusing on AI-generated data, specifically how I handle missing parameters (`value === null`). My priority is not to overwrite manually entered or verified values. If a new image presents a conflicting value, I need to store it as `conflictValue` and alert the user for manual review. Rejected drafts also need special handling; I will only allow recreation via a dedicated \"Restore/Recreate\" button.\n\n\n**Prioritizing AI Verification**\n\nI\'m now separating verified and draft AI volumes in both the calculator display and Excel exports. I will highlight \'Draft AI\' with a badge needing verification, and *unverified* jobs will not contribute to the final total. I will add a `Volume Draf` to show unverified AI data. I\'m building filters in `WorkTable`, plus bulk approval, and per-item buttons for approving, editing, and rejecting AI drafts. I\'ll also add an analysis summary to the `AIAssistantModal`.\n\n\n**Organizing AI Results**\n\nI\'m now implementing distinct tabs within the AI results modal: \"Automatically Created Jobs (AI Drafts)\" and \"Incomplete Jobs.\" I\'m also adding \"Extracted Dimensions & Parameters\" with unit conversion, and \"Recommended Jobs\" for one-click addition. I\'m also implementing a \"View AI Jobs in Calculator\" button.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_244354"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * RuangRAB - Type Definitions\\n * Quantity Takeoff & Konstruksi Volume Calculator\\n */\\n\\nexport type WorkCategory = \'Persiapan Dll\' | \'Struktural\' | \'Arsitektural\' | \'MEP\';\\n\\nexport type CalculationStatus =\\n  | \'Lengkap\'\\n  | \'Belum Lengkap\'\\n  | \'Perlu Input\'\\n  | \'Draf AI \342\200\224 Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n  | \'Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n  | \'Rumus Perlu Dikonfigurasi\'\\n  | \'Rumus Belum Dipetakan\'\\n  | \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\'\\n  | \'Tidak Digunakan\';\\n\\nexport type ParameterType = \'number\' | \'text\' | \'select\';\\n\\nexport type DrawingUnit = \'mm\' | \'cm\' | \'m\';\\n\\nexport type DrawingScale =\\n  | \'1:20\'\\n  | \'1:50\'\\n  | \'1:75\'\\n  | \'1:100\'\\n  | \'1:150\'\\n  | \'1:200\'\\n  | \'custom\'\\n  | \'unknown\';\\n\\nexport interface ParameterConflict {\\n  newValue: number;\\n  rawExtractedValue: number;\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit;\\n  sourceDocument: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParameterItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  value: number | string | null;\\n  unit: string;\\n  type?: ParameterType;\\n  required?: boolean;\\n  source?: \'manual\' | \'ai\' | \'derived\' | \'reference\';\\n  sourceDocument?: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n  rawExtractedValue?: number;\\n  rawUnit?: DrawingUnit;\\n  isVerified?: boolean;\\n  conflict?: ParameterConflict | null;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  excelCellRef?: string; // Disimpan secara internal, tidak ditampilkan di UI\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WorkComponent {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string; // e.g., \\\"Bagian 1\\\", \\\"Balok B1\\\", \\\"Dinding Depan\\\"\\n  parameters: Record<string, number | null>;\\n  formulaText?: string;\\n  computedVolume?: number | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CatalogWorkItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  code?: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  category: WorkCategory;\\n  subCategory?: string;\\n  floorRule: \'umum\' | \'per_lantai\' | \'atap_saja\' | \'fondasi_saja\';\\n  description: string;\\n  defaultUnit: string;\\n  formulaDisplay: string;\\n  customFormula?: string;\\n  isCustomCatalog?: boolean;\\n  excelSheet: string; // Internal metadata\\n  excelCell: string; // Internal metadata\\n  excelFormula?: string; // Internal metadata\\n  parameters: ParameterItem[];\\n  defaultComponents?: WorkComponent[];\\n  calculationMethod: (params: Record<string, number>, components?: WorkComponent[]) => number | null;\\n  verificationStatus: CalculationStatus;\\n  verificationNotes?: string;\\n  hasExternalRef?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProjectWorkItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  catalogId?: string;\\n  dedupKey?: string; // Kunci stabil pencegahan duplikasi (floorId + catalogId + elementLocation)\\n  name: string;\\n  category: WorkCategory;\\n  subCategory?: string;\\n  floorId: string; // \\\"fl-umum\\\" atau floorId\\n  elementLocation?: string; // Lokasi / As / Ruang dari gambar\\n  unit: string;\\n  formulaDisplay: string;\\n  parameters: ParameterItem[];\\n  components: WorkComponent[];\\n  calculatedVolume: number | null;\\n  status: CalculationStatus;\\n  statusMessage?: string;\\n  origin?: \'manual\' | \'ai\';\\n  aiVerificationStatus?: \'draft\' | \'verified\' | \'rejected\';\\n  sourceDocument?: string;\\n  identificationReason?: string;\\n  excelSheet?: string; // Internal metadata\\n  excelCell?: string; // Internal metadata\\n  excelFormula?: string; // Internal metadata\\n  customFormula?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  isActive: boolean;\\n  lastUpdated?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FloorItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string; // e.g. \\\"Lantai 1\\\", \\\"Lantai 2\\\", \\\"Lantai 3\\\", \\\"Rooftop\\\", \\\"Basement\\\", \\\"Umum\\\"\\n  level: number; // 0 for umum/pondasi, 1 for Lantai 1, etc.\\n  elevation?: string; // e.g. \\\"+ 0.00 m\\\", \\\"+ 4.00 m\\\"\\n  description?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProjectData {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  location?: string;\\n  description?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  floorCount: number;\\n  floors: FloorItem[];\\n  works: ProjectWorkItem[];\\n  rejectedDraftKeys?: string[]; // Daftar dedupKey draf AI yang pernah ditolak/dihapus pengguna\\n  catalogVersion: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIExtractionItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  targetCategory: string;\\n  suggestedWorkName: string;\\n  catalogId?: string; // ID template katalog yang cocok\\n  parameterId?: string; // ID parameter pada katalog (panjang, lebar, tinggi, luas_lantai, dll)\\n  parameterName: string;\\n  rawExtractedValue: number; // Nilai angka dimensi tertulis pada gambar (misal 300, 600, 1270)\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit; // Satuan dimensi gambar (mm, cm, m)\\n  explicitUnitOnDrawing?: string; // Jika pada gambar tertulis satuan eksplisit berbeda\\n  convertedValue: number; // Nilai hasil konversi standar kalkulator (misal 3.00 m)\\n  convertedUnit: string; // Satuan kalkulator (m, m\302\262, m\302\263, unit, buah)\\n  confidence: number; // 0 to 1\\n  sourceDocument: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  userCorrection?: number;\\n  status: \'pending\' | \'approved\' | \'rejected\' | \'applied\';\\n  targetWorkId?: string;\\n  targetParamId?: string;\\n  isRecommendationOnly?: boolean; // True jika hanya rekomendasi lanjutan (bukan terdeteksi eksplisit)\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIAutoTakeoffSummary {\\n  documentSummary: string;\\n  drawingType: \'arsitektur_denah\' | \'struktur_denah\' | \'potongan_detail\' | \'lainnya\';\\n  identifiedFloor: string;\\n  identifiedScale: string;\\n  extractedCount: number;\\n  createdDraftWorksCount: number;\\n  updatedExistingWorksCount: number;\\n  incompleteWorksCount: number;\\n  conflictCount: number;\\n  recommendations: {\\n    catalogId: string;\\n    name: string;\\n    category: WorkCategory;\\n    reason: string;\\n  }[];\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Update TypeScript definitions in src/types/index.ts to support Auto Quantity Takeoff, AI draft verification status, conflict detection, and custom catalog items\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating type definitions in src/types/index.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update src/types/index.ts\"}"
