  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Data Verification Notes**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `src/data/uscCatalog.ts` file. Specifically, I\'m scrutinizing the `verificationNotes` within `CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS`. I\'ve found mentions of direct verification from specific cells in the USC workbook, like G12 and G52/G53. There are also notes about specific cell calculations like `\"K85 = 0.3 / 0.4m, M85 = 0.6m.\"` I\'m focusing on clarifying how these cell references and calculations ensure data accuracy.\n\n\n**Refining Verification Messaging**\n\nI\'m now thinking about how to refine the verification messaging. I realize we should avoid exposing raw Excel cell references in the UI or even `calculationEngine.ts`. Instead, I\'ll use clean Indonesian messages for status updates like \"Seluruh parameter perhitungan lengkap\". Only when verification is *needed* would I include a clean note, absent of cell coordinates.\n\nI also noticed the inconsistency in `ars-dinding-bata-hebel` regarding `\'tinggi_dinding\'` and how Auto Quantity Takeoff specifications handle missing height data. The height is populated from excel with hardcoded value 3.4.\n\n\n**Adjusting Height Parameter Logic**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the handling of `tinggi_dinding` in `ars-dinding-bata-hebel`, and how this impacts work item status. It turns out the hardcoded default `3.4` in the calculation is a problem when height is missing from floor plans used to draft AI work. I\'m thinking, in such cases, `tinggi_dinding` should be explicitly set to `null` to trigger a \"Belum Lengkap\" status and a manual input prompt, which I\'ll render in clean Indonesian. Existing calculations using default or explicit values must remain functional. I\'m verifying the fix doesn\'t affect `createDefaultUscProject()` functionality.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_207102"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Ensure ars-dinding-bata-hebel requires tinggi_dinding instead of falling back to 3.4 when null\", \"EndLine\":884, \"Instruction\":\"Require tinggi_dinding parameter in calculationMethod of ars-dinding-bata-hebel\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"    calculationMethod: (params) => {\\n      const p = params[\'panjang_keliling\'];\\n      const t = params[\'tinggi_dinding\'];\\n      const b = params[\'luas_bukaan\'] || 0;\\n      if (p == null || isNaN(p) || t == null || isNaN(t)) return null;\\n      return Math.max(0, p * t - b);\\n    },\", \"StartLine\":875, \"TargetContent\":\"    calculationMethod: (params) => {\\n      const p = params[\'panjang_keliling\'];\\n      const t = params[\'tinggi_dinding\'] ?? 3.4;\\n      const b = params[\'luas_bukaan\'] || 0;\\n      if (p == null || isNaN(p)) return null;\\n      return Math.max(0, p * t - b);\\n    },\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/data/uscCatalog.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating wall calculation method in catalog\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update wall calculation method in /src/data/uscCatalog.ts\"}"
