  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Calculation Engine**\n\nI\'m currently focused on updating the `calculationEngine.ts` file. Specifically, I\'m examining the `calculateWorkItemVolume` function. My main concern is broadening the catalog item lookup, potentially extending beyond `CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS` to accommodate custom catalog entries. I\'m exploring how to best handle those custom cases within the volume calculation.\n\n\n**Refining Volume Calculation Logic**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `customFormula` logic within the volume calculation. When `missingRequired` is true, the `item.origin` determines the specific message. Success now triggers a check for AI draft status and parameter conflicts, refining the output accordingly, including the message. I\'m also ensuring Excel cell references are stripped from messages to prevent leakage.\n\n\n**Isolating Draft Volumes**\n\nI\'m now segregating verified works from AI draft works in the volume calculation, summing volume metrics only for verified entries. I\'m also computing the `draftWorksCount`, `readyDraftWorksCount`, and `incompleteDraftWorksCount`, along with the respective draft volume metrics: `draftBetonM3`, and `draftLuasM2`, to align with the need to explicitly separate draft and final volumes.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_240346"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Update calculationEngine.ts to support AI draft status, incomplete parameter guidance, conflict detection, and separation of draft vs verified volumes in computeProjectSummaries\", \"EndLine\":404, \"Instruction\":\"Update calculateWorkItemVolume and computeProjectSummaries in /src/services/calculationEngine.ts\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Cari item pada katalog bawaan\\n  const catalogEntry = CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS.find((c) => c.id === item.catalogId);\\n  const isAiDraft = item.origin === \'ai\' && item.aiVerificationStatus === \'draft\';\\n  const hasConflict = item.parameters.some((p) => Boolean(p.conflict));\\n\\n  // Kumpulkan nilai parameter dalam bentuk Record<string, number>\\n  const paramMap: Record<string, number> = {};\\n  const missingParams: string[] = [];\\n\\n  for (const p of item.parameters) {\\n    if (p.value !== null && p.value !== \'\' && !isNaN(Number(p.value))) {\\n      paramMap[p.id] = Number(p.value);\\n    } else if (p.required) {\\n      // Cek apakah ada nilai turunan dari pekerjaan lain\\n      if (p.id === \'volume_galian\') {\\n        const galianWork = allProjectWorks.find(\\n          (w) =>\\n            w.isActive &&\\n            w.aiVerificationStatus !== \'draft\' &&\\n            (w.id.includes(\'galian\') || w.name.toLowerCase().includes(\'galian\'))\\n        );\\n        if (galianWork && galianWork.calculatedVolume !== null) {\\n          paramMap[p.id] = galianWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.value = galianWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.source = \'derived\';\\n          continue;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      if (p.id === \'luas_dinding_bersih\') {\\n        const dindingWork = allProjectWorks.find(\\n          (w) =>\\n            w.isActive &&\\n            w.floorId === item.floorId &&\\n            (w.name.toLowerCase().includes(\'dinding bata\') || w.id.includes(\'dinding\'))\\n        );\\n        if (dindingWork && dindingWork.calculatedVolume !== null) {\\n          paramMap[p.id] = dindingWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.value = dindingWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.source = \'derived\';\\n          continue;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      missingParams.push(p.label || p.name);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  if (missingParams.length > 0) {\\n    const missingList = missingParams.join(\', \');\\n    return {\\n      volume: null,\\n      status: isAiDraft ? \'Belum Lengkap\' : \'Perlu Input\',\\n      message: isAiDraft\\n        ? `Parameter \\\"${missingList}\\\" belum tercantum pada gambar ini. Silakan isi manual atau unggah gambar potongan/detail.`\\n        : `Parameter \\\"${missingList}\\\" belum diisi.`,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  // Helper untuk menentukan status akhir setelah volume berhasil dihitung\\n  const finalizeStatus = (vol: number): { volume: number; status: CalculationStatus; message?: string } => {\\n    if (isAiDraft) {\\n      return {\\n        volume: vol,\\n        status: \'Draf AI \342\200\224 Perlu Verifikasi\',\\n        message: hasConflict\\n          ? \'Terdapat perbedaan dimensi antar gambar \342\200\224 periksa konflik parameter sebelum menyetujui.\'\\n          : \'Draf pekerjaan dari pembacaan AI \342\200\224 periksa parameter lalu klik Setujui untuk masuk ke rekap final.\',\\n      };\\n    }\\n\\n    if (hasConflict) {\\n      return {\\n        volume: vol,\\n        status: \'Perlu Verifikasi\',\\n        message: \'Terdapat perbedaan dimensi dari gambar baru \342\200\224 tinjau parameter.\',\\n      };\\n    }\\n\\n    return {\\n      volume: vol,\\n      status: \'Lengkap\',\\n      message: \'Parameter lengkap dan terverifikasi.\',\\n    };\\n  };\\n\\n  // Jika pekerjaan memiliki ekspresi rumus kustom (atau dari katalog kustom)\\n  if (item.customFormula) {\\n    const customResult = safeEvaluateMath(item.customFormula, paramMap);\\n    if (isNaN(customResult) || !isFinite(customResult)) {\\n      return {\\n        volume: null,\\n        status: \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\',\\n        message: \'Rumus kustom menghasilkan kesalahan evaluasi matematika.\',\\n      };\\n    }\\n    return finalizeStatus(customResult);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Jalankan rumus kalkulasi katalog\\n  if (catalogEntry) {\\n    try {\\n      const result = catalogEntry.calculationMethod(paramMap, item.components);\\n      if (result === null || isNaN(result)) {\\n        return {\\n          volume: null,\\n          status: isAiDraft ? \'Belum Lengkap\' : \'Perlu Input\',\\n          message: \'Parameter wajib belum lengkap.\',\\n        };\\n      }\\n\\n      if (!isFinite(result)) {\\n        return {\\n          volume: null,\\n          status: \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\',\\n          message: \'Terjadi pembagian dengan nol atau nilai tak terhingga.\',\\n        };\\n      }\\n\\n      return finalizeStatus(result);\\n    } catch (err: unknown) {\\n      const errorMsg = err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err);\\n      return {\\n        volume: null,\\n        status: \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\',\\n        message: errorMsg || \'Gagal menghitung rumus.\',\\n      };\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // Default: coba perkalian sederhana parameter yang ada\\n  const keys = Object.keys(paramMap);\\n  if (keys.length > 0) {\\n    const product = keys.reduce((acc, k) => acc * paramMap[k], 1);\\n    return finalizeStatus(product);\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    volume: null,\\n    status: isAiDraft ? \'Belum Lengkap\' : \'Perlu Input\',\\n    message: \'Isi parameter perhitungan.\',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Hitung ulang seluruh daftar pekerjaan dalam proyek dengan penanganan dependensi\\n */\\nexport function recalculateAllProjectWorks(works: ProjectWorkItem[]): ProjectWorkItem[] {\\n  // Jalankan dua pass untuk menyelesaikan nilai turunan (derived dependencies)\\n  let updatedWorks = [...works];\\n\\n  for (let pass = 0; pass < 2; pass++) {\\n    updatedWorks = updatedWorks.map((work) => {\\n      const { volume, status, message } = calculateWorkItemVolume(work, updatedWorks);\\n      return {\\n        ...work,\\n        calculatedVolume: volume,\\n        status,\\n        statusMessage: message,\\n      };\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  return updatedWorks;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Format angka ke standar Indonesia (titik untuk ribuan, koma untuk desimal)\\n * Contoh: 1224.5 -> \\\"1.224,50\\\"\\n */\\nexport function formatIndonesianNumber(\\n  val: number | null | undefined,\\n  decimals: number = 2\\n): string {\\n  if (val === null || val === undefined || isNaN(val)) return \'-\';\\n  const parts = val.toFixed(decimals).split(\'.\');\\n  const intPart = parts[0].replace(/\\\\B(?=(\\\\d{3})+(?!\\\\d))/g, \'.\');\\n  return decimals > 0 && parts[1] ? `${intPart},${parts[1]}` : intPart;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Ringkasan Volume berdasarkan Kategori dan Unit\\n */\\nexport interface CategoryVolumeSummary {\\n  category: string;\\n  count: number;\\n  completedCount: number;\\n  totalVolumeM3: number;\\n  totalAreaM2: number;\\n  totalLengthM: number;\\n  totalUnits: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport function computeProjectSummaries(works: ProjectWorkItem[]) {\\n  const activeWorks = works.filter((w) => w.isActive);\\n\\n  let totalBetonM3 = 0;\\n  let totalLuasM2 = 0;\\n  let totalPanjangM = 0;\\n  let totalItemsCompleted = 0;\\n  let totalItemsPending = 0;\\n\\n  let draftWorksCount = 0;\\n  let readyDraftWorksCount = 0;\\n  let incompleteDraftWorksCount = 0;\\n  let draftBetonM3 = 0;\\n  let draftLuasM2 = 0;\\n  let draftPanjangM = 0;\\n  let conflictWorksCount = 0;\\n\\n  for (const w of activeWorks) {\\n    const isAiDraft = w.origin === \'ai\' && w.aiVerificationStatus === \'draft\';\\n    const hasConflict = w.parameters.some((p) => Boolean(p.conflict));\\n    if (hasConflict) {\\n      conflictWorksCount++;\\n    }\\n\\n    const vol = w.calculatedVolume;\\n    const u = w.unit.toLowerCase().trim();\\n\\n    if (isAiDraft) {\\n      draftWorksCount++;\\n      totalItemsPending++;\\n      if (vol !== null && !isNaN(vol)) {\\n        readyDraftWorksCount++;\\n        if (u === \'m3\' || u === \'m\302\263\') {\\n          draftBetonM3 += vol;\\n        } else if (u === \'m2\' || u === \'m\302\262\') {\\n          draftLuasM2 += vol;\\n        } else if (u === \'m\' || u === \\\"m\'\\\" || u === \'m1\') {\\n          draftPanjangM += vol;\\n        }\\n      } else {\\n        incompleteDraftWorksCount++;\\n      }\\n      continue;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (w.status === \'Lengkap\') {\\n      totalItemsCompleted++;\\n    } else {\\n      totalItemsPending++;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (vol !== null && !isNaN(vol)) {\\n      if (u === \'m3\' || u === \'m\302\263\') {\\n        totalBetonM3 += vol;\\n      } else if (u === \'m2\' || u === \'m\302\262\') {\\n        totalLuasM2 += vol;\\n      } else if (u === \'m\' || u === \\\"m\'\\\" || u === \'m1\') {\\n        totalPanjangM += vol;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    totalWorks: activeWorks.length,\\n    completedWorks: totalItemsCompleted,\\n    pendingWorks: totalItemsPending,\\n    totalBetonM3,\\n    totalLuasM2,\\n    totalPanjangM,\\n    draftWorksCount,\\n    readyDraftWorksCount,\\n    incompleteDraftWorksCount,\\n    draftBetonM3,\\n    draftLuasM2,\\n    draftPanjangM,\\n    conflictWorksCount,\\n  };\\n}\\n\", \"StartLine\":200, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Cari item pada katalog bawaan\\n  const catalogEntry = CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS.find((c) => c.id === item.catalogId);\\n\\n  // Kumpulkan nilai parameter dalam bentuk Record<string, number>\\n  const paramMap: Record<string, number> = {};\\n  let missingRequired = false;\\n  let missingParamName = \'\';\\n\\n  for (const p of item.parameters) {\\n    if (p.value !== null && p.value !== \'\' && !isNaN(Number(p.value))) {\\n      paramMap[p.id] = Number(p.value);\\n    } else if (p.required) {\\n      // Cek apakah ada nilai turunan dari pekerjaan lain\\n      if (p.id === \'volume_galian\') {\\n        const galianWork = allProjectWorks.find(\\n          (w) => w.id.includes(\'galian\') || w.name.toLowerCase().includes(\'galian\')\\n        );\\n        if (galianWork && galianWork.calculatedVolume !== null) {\\n          paramMap[p.id] = galianWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.value = galianWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.source = \'derived\';\\n          continue;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      if (p.id === \'luas_dinding_bersih\') {\\n        const dindingWork = allProjectWorks.find(\\n          (w) => w.floorId === item.floorId && (w.name.toLowerCase().includes(\'dinding bata\') || w.id.includes(\'dinding\'))\\n        );\\n        if (dindingWork && dindingWork.calculatedVolume !== null) {\\n          paramMap[p.id] = dindingWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.value = dindingWork.calculatedVolume;\\n          p.source = \'derived\';\\n          continue;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      missingRequired = true;\\n      missingParamName = p.label || p.name;\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  if (missingRequired) {\\n    return {\\n      volume: null,\\n      status: \'Perlu Input\',\\n      message: `Parameter \\\"${missingParamName}\\\" belum diisi.`,\\n    };\\n  }\\n\\n  // Jalankan rumus kalkulasi katalog\\n  if (catalogEntry) {\\n    try {\\n      const result = catalogEntry.calculationMethod(paramMap, item.components);\\n      if (result === null || isNaN(result)) {\\n        return {\\n          volume: null,\\n          status: \'Perlu Input\',\\n          message: \'Parameter wajib belum lengkap.\',\\n        };\\n      }\\n\\n      if (!isFinite(result)) {\\n        return {\\n          volume: null,\\n          status: \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\',\\n          message: \'Terjadi pembagian dengan nol atau nilai tak terhingga.\',\\n        };\\n      }\\n\\n      const status: CalculationStatus =\\n        catalogEntry.verificationStatus === \'Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n          ? \'Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n          : \'Lengkap\';\\n\\n      return {\\n        volume: result,\\n        status,\\n        message: catalogEntry.verificationNotes,\\n      };\\n    } catch (err: unknown) {\\n      const errorMsg = err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err);\\n      return {\\n        volume: null,\\n        status: \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\',\\n        message: errorMsg || \'Gagal menghitung rumus.\',\\n      };\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // Jika pekerjaan kustom dengan ekspresi rumus buatan pengguna\\n  if (item.customFormula) {\\n    const customResult = safeEvaluateMath(item.customFormula, paramMap);\\n    if (isNaN(customResult) || !isFinite(customResult)) {\\n      return {\\n        volume: null,\\n        status: \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\',\\n        message: \'Rumus kustom menghasilkan kesalahan evaluasi matematika.\',\\n      };\\n    }\\n    return { volume: customResult, status: \'Lengkap\' };\\n  }\\n\\n  // Default: coba perkalian sederhana parameter yang ada\\n  const keys = Object.keys(paramMap);\\n  if (keys.length > 0) {\\n    const product = keys.reduce((acc, k) => acc * paramMap[k], 1);\\n    return { volume: product, status: \'Lengkap\' };\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    volume: null,\\n    status: \'Perlu Input\',\\n    message: \'Isi parameter perhitungan.\',\\n  };\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Hitung ulang seluruh daftar pekerjaan dalam proyek dengan penanganan dependensi\\n */\\nexport function recalculateAllProjectWorks(works: ProjectWorkItem[]): ProjectWorkItem[] {\\n  // Jalankan dua pass untuk menyelesaikan nilai turunan (derived dependencies)\\n  let updatedWorks = [...works];\\n\\n  for (let pass = 0; pass < 2; pass++) {\\n    updatedWorks = updatedWorks.map((work) => {\\n      const { volume, status, message } = calculateWorkItemVolume(work, updatedWorks);\\n      return {\\n        ...work,\\n        calculatedVolume: volume,\\n        status,\\n        statusMessage: message,\\n      };\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  return updatedWorks;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Format angka ke standar Indonesia (titik untuk ribuan, koma untuk desimal)\\n * Contoh: 1224.5 -> \\\"1.224,50\\\"\\n */\\nexport function formatIndonesianNumber(\\n  val: number | null | undefined,\\n  decimals: number = 2\\n): string {\\n  if (val === null || val === undefined || isNaN(val)) return \'-\';\\n  const parts = val.toFixed(decimals).split(\'.\');\\n  const intPart = parts[0].replace(/\\\\B(?=(\\\\d{3})+(?!\\\\d))/g, \'.\');\\n  return decimals > 0 && parts[1] ? `${intPart},${parts[1]}` : intPart;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Ringkasan Volume berdasarkan Kategori dan Unit\\n */\\nexport interface CategoryVolumeSummary {\\n  category: string;\\n  count: number;\\n  completedCount: number;\\n  totalVolumeM3: number;\\n  totalAreaM2: number;\\n  totalLengthM: number;\\n  totalUnits: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport function computeProjectSummaries(works: ProjectWorkItem[]) {\\n  const activeWorks = works.filter((w) => w.isActive);\\n\\n  let totalBetonM3 = 0;\\n  let totalLuasM2 = 0;\\n  let totalPanjangM = 0;\\n  let totalItemsCompleted = 0;\\n  let totalItemsPending = 0;\\n\\n  for (const w of activeWorks) {\\n    if (w.status === \'Lengkap\') {\\n      totalItemsCompleted++;\\n    } else {\\n      totalItemsPending++;\\n    }\\n\\n    const vol = w.calculatedVolume;\\n    if (vol !== null && !isNaN(vol)) {\\n      const u = w.unit.toLowerCase().trim();\\n      if (u === \'m3\' || u === \'m\302\263\') {\\n        totalBetonM3 += vol;\\n      } else if (u === \'m2\' || u === \'m\302\262\') {\\n        totalLuasM2 += vol;\\n      } else if (u === \'m\' || u === \'m\\\\\'\' || u === \'m1\') {\\n        totalPanjangM += vol;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  return {\\n    totalWorks: activeWorks.length,\\n    completedWorks: totalItemsCompleted,\\n    pendingWorks: totalItemsPending,\\n    totalBetonM3,\\n    totalLuasM2,\\n    totalPanjangM,\\n  };\\n}\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/services/calculationEngine.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating calculationEngine.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update /src/services/calculationEngine.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\356\027\n\353\027\001i\024}\023\370P\320*\311\223\311q\227\331\021\373K_u\221\363q\224\253\212&\2416\311_\221\t\356\330\227P\037F\230\261\204\306\031\247\016s\f7\314,\265\305\260\334k\016A\250\315a4\n,\373`\272sz\364Z\245?\255\205L\330\302I<i\351\343\324\362\tWd\310\266\220\001\300r\203A~AT\254\">\263\221\b\024\\\212\247\235/P6\305\373\206-#\251d%\313\266\362\317\335\272#^%\236q\346\210\025\372k\267\342\301\331\316\254\265\336\223=*u\277\257\212!x\274a\231T;\265i\2134\216\245\360B\242\306=\232\227\331\254\233\313\366\203\227|\026\3435{K\230\364\a\265<~\213?\357\342\031\352C\230vi\302U\332k\321\332\370\326\343\t\200\017\325\347\373\032\206%2\304\254\273\252\r\260\255T\\?\215\tn\372\246(7\032\3036`Dt\341\205Q\252\240\307\227\370(k\343\265h\f\342I\336\005\231.\235\265\r\247f\300\3165\315t\357\365>E\273\233\a\306\034\314\345in\353\212x\241\020p\016\275?\2369\366>\230Pl_\\\210\322\264z\217sc\202\362\337\020\206.n.\221{\221\374\242\370\377\225NIH\226r\314\374\003\r\3229Z\205\244\\$+\267\237v\310C\306\0252\211U\373E\bT\321\225\312\330N3\245\277\005\252\003J:\\0s\366\244\365m\300\320\037\025<\272@:|R\247\217\276\311iT\213\024\216{\374\b\265vu\311\350\\\'{g\312/\251\375\2141\200\372\f\334!lK\a\255\326\221a\226\353\212}\227\277\331\\t tj\f\373\367E\265\317\274\200\200\354H\214\371s\v\256\333%\226\232p\'\020e\315\315\311\374\n\303 O\346\352\330\204\305X\245\tl^\n5\340\017\212&5\217\334_%4U\347$H<\031@\003\002\371\236\177\331\276\360\n\210\227d\254\350\207\215\320\237\027\335\231i\200\033\334ztbrgF\302\221\"28\200\231q?{\255%\263VR+\350\260;\321\3206\251v\213\0256\202\212\f=Vp%k\225\031$&D\006?_3G)\222\201\354vY3\376\322\250\234Q\nOe`\317\365{f\303\312\324\020\273\351\355H:\252V\201\005o\264\371@\265yVn\323if\034\245\306s0\034\023S\215\241\033)\323\034\005\033\032\306\355\265\236\001=\034\2708Z\\\220\a\001\3665\230\253\322\277+\301\246?\307\006\254\270\264\303\355z\031_\343-_8\233\346[\276.\005\232\n\345\365b\177j\\\274\324\032\254\231\316h\371\2