  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Enhance the existing **RuangRAB \342\200\224 AI Quantity Takeoff & Kalkulator Volume Konstruksi** web application (`fe31a1d6-62db-405b-8277-2f5da668fc00`) without rebuilding from scratch or breaking the working Gemini PDF/drawing analysis.\n   - **Required Deliverables & Success Criteria**:\n     1. **Responsive Collapsible Sidebar**:\n        - Desktop: Toggle between expanded (`w-64`, icon + label) and collapsed (`w-20`, icon-only with tooltips). Persist preference in `localStorage`.\n        - Mobile (`< md`): Hidden by default, opened via a hamburger button in `Header.tsx` as a slide-over drawer with backdrop overlay and close button.\n        - Main content automatically expands when the sidebar is collapsed (`flex-1 min-w-0 transition-all duration-200`).\n     2. **Work Item Management & Deletion (Calculator vs. Catalog)**:\n        - **In Calculator (`WorkTable.tsx`)**: Direct **Setujui** (for complete AI drafts), **Edit**, and **Hapus** buttons on each work row. Deletion uses a custom React confirmation modal (no `window.confirm`). Deleting from the calculator removes it from the active project, updates counts/recap/storage, and records rejected/deleted AI draft keys (`rejectedDraftKeys`) so re-analyzing the same PDF does not recreate rejected drafts without user consent.\n        - **In Catalog (`AddWorkModal.tsx`)**: Built-in catalog works can be disabled/hidden from the catalog and re-enabled via a toggle (`disabledCatalogIds` persisted in `localStorage`). Custom catalog templates (`customCatalogItems` persisted in `localStorage`) can be created, edited, and permanently deleted with confirmation (warning the user if the template is currently used in the active project, without silently deleting project work items).\n     3. **Auto Quantity Takeoff (Direct AI-to-Calculator Integration)**:\n        - When Gemini finishes analyzing a drawing/PDF (`AIAssistantModal.tsx`), automatically match extracted elements/dimensions against the catalog (`CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS`) and create or update **AI Draft work items** (`origin: \'ai\'`, `aiVerificationStatus: \'draft\'`) on the target floor in the calculator.\n        - Only create works genuinely supported by drawing evidence (e.g., for architectural floor plan `rencana_1-Model_2ceb7bed.pdf`: overall building dimensions -> Pembersihan Lahan & Bouwplank; wall length -> Dinding Bata Ringan with `tinggi_dinding` left empty `null` so status is **Belum Lengkap**; room areas -> Homogenous Tile 60x60 & Keramik Lantai Toilet 40x40).\n        - Secondary/follow-up works not explicitly shown on a floor plan (e.g., Plesteran & Acian, Pengecatan, Plafond, Keramik Dinding Toilet) are listed as **Rekomendasi Pekerjaan Lanjutan** that the user can optionally add with 1 click.\n        - Prevent duplication using a stable `dedupKey` (`${floorId}::${catalogId}`). Re-analyzing the same PDF is idempotent. Analyzing an additional drawing (e.g. section/elevation) fills missing parameters (such as `tinggi_dinding`) without overwriting verified/manual parameters, and flags dimension conflicts (`ParameterConflict`) if two drawings disagree.\n        - Separate **Volume Draf** (unverified AI works) from **Volume Terverifikasi (Final)**. Unverified AI drafts (`aiVerificationStatus === \'draft\'`) are NOT added to the final Recap Total Volume until the user approves them (individually or via **\"Setujui Semua yang Lengkap\"**).\n     4. **Clean All Raw Excel/USC References from UI**:\n        - Remove all visible strings like `Ref: Volume Struktural...`, `Sel Sumber: G9`, `Referensi Excel USC`, `RAB Gedung USC.xlsx`, cell coordinates, and raw Excel formulas from `WorkTable.tsx`, `WorkDetailModal.tsx`, `AddWorkModal.tsx`, and `Sidebar.tsx`.\n        - Keep all internal metadata (`excelSheet`, `excelCell`, `excelFormula`, `excelCellRef`) intact in TypeScript objects and `src/data/uscCatalog.ts`.\n   - **Scope Boundaries**: Strictly Quantity Takeoff (Volume) only. Do NOT add AHSP, unit prices, RAB cost calculations, or S-curves.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed & Saved Files**:\n     - `/src/types/index.ts`: Added `ParameterConflict`, `DrawingUnit`, `DrawingScale`, `AIAutoTakeoffSummary`, and extended `ParameterItem`, `CatalogWorkItem`, `ProjectWorkItem`, `ProjectData`, and `AIExtractionItem`.\n     - `/src/data/uscCatalog.ts`: Updated `ars-dinding-bata-hebel` `calculationMethod` so it requires `tinggi_dinding` instead of falling back to `3.4` when `tinggi_dinding` is `null` (enabling `Belum Lengkap` status for floor-plan-only wall takeoff).\n     - `/server.ts`: Updated `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` prompt and `responseSchema` to include `drawingType`, `catalogId`, and `parameterId` mapping while keeping exponential backoff + jitter and fast fallback from `gemini-3.8-flash` to `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`.\n     - `/src/services/calculationEngine.ts`: Updated `calculateWorkItemVolume` to handle `Draf AI \342\200\224 Perlu Verifikasi`, `Belum Lengkap` with missing parameter guidance, conflict status, and stripped raw Excel cell notes. Updated `computeProjectSummaries` to separate verified totals (`totalBetonM3`, `totalLuasM2`, `totalPanjangM`) from AI draft totals (`draftWorksCount`, `readyDraftWorksCount`, `incompleteDraftWorksCount`, `draftBetonM3`, `draftLuasM2`, `draftPanjangM`, `conflictWorksCount`).\n     - `/src/services/projectStorage.ts`: Added `loadSidebarCollapsed`, `saveSidebarCollapsed`, `loadDisabledCatalogIds`, `saveDisabledCatalogIds`, `loadCustomCatalogItems`, `saveCustomCatalogItems`, `getAllCatalogItems`, updated `createProjectWorkFromCatalog`, and implemented `applyAutoQuantityTakeoff`.\n     - `/src/components/Sidebar.tsx`: Implemented desktop collapsible sidebar (`w-64` vs `w-20` with smooth 200ms transition) and mobile slide-over drawer with backdrop overlay and close button. Cleaned Tips Estimator text.\n     - `/src/components/Header.tsx`: Added mobile hamburger menu button (`onOpenMobileMenu`) and desktop sidebar collapse toggle (`isSidebarCollapsed`, `onToggleSidebarCollapse`).\n     - `/src/components/WorkTable.tsx`: Removed all `Ref: USC!...` Excel strings, added the AI Draft verification banner with **\"Setujui Semua yang Lengkap\"**, status filter pills (`Semua Status`, `Draf AI`, `Perlu Input / Belum Lengkap`), direct **Setujui**, **Edit**, and **Hapus** buttons on each row, and a custom React confirmation modal for deleting work items.\n     - `/src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx`: Removed `Sel Sumber` and `Referensi Excel USC` tab, added **`Sumber & Verifikasi`** tab, parameter source badges, inline **Konflik Dimensi Antar Gambar** resolution buttons (`Pakai Lama` vs `Pakai Baru`), and **\"Simpan & Setujui Draf AI\"** button.\n     - `/src/components/AddWorkModal.tsx`: Added built-in catalog hide/re-enable toggle (`disabledCatalogIds`) and custom catalog template create/edit/permanent delete with confirmation and active project usage impact warning.\n     - `/src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`: Implemented the 5-stage Auto Quantity Takeoff UI with automatic draft work creation, summary banner, 3 result tabs (`Draf Pekerjaan Kalkulator`, `Tabel Dimensi Terbaca`, `Rekomendasi Lanjutan`), 1-click sample PDF loader (`rencana_1-Model_2ceb7bed.pdf`), and **\"Lihat Pekerjaan Hasil AI di Kalkulator\"** button.\n   - **Remaining Files to Edit**:\n     - `/src/App.tsx`: Wire the new props and handlers (`isSidebarCollapsed`, `isMobileMenuOpen`, `handleAutoTakeoff`, `handleApproveDraftWork`, `handleApproveAllReadyDrafts`, `handleAddRecommendationWork`, `handleDeleteWork` recording `rejectedDraftKeys`, and displaying separated Draft Volume vs Verified Volume in the bottom Recap cards).\n     - `/src/services/excelExport.ts`: Update so AI Draft status (`Draf AI` vs `Terverifikasi`) is clearly labeled and raw internal USC references are cleaned if appropriate.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - In `App.tsx`, `AIAssistantModal` previously took `onApplyExtractedParameters`. It now takes `onAutoTakeoff`, `onAddRecommendationWork`, `onApproveDraftWork`, `onApproveAllReadyDrafts`, and `onOpenWorkDetail`.\n   - `Sidebar` now requires `isCollapsed`, `onToggleCollapse`, `isMobileOpen`, and `onCloseMobile`.\n   - `Header` now requires `onOpenMobileMenu`, `isSidebarCollapsed`, and `onToggleSidebarCollapse`.\n   - `WorkTable` now accepts `onApproveDraftWork` and `onApproveAllReadyDrafts`, and handles its own delete confirmation modal before calling `onDeleteWork(workId)`. Therefore, `handleDeleteWork` in `App.tsx` should NOT call `window.confirm()`, and if the deleted work has `dedupKey`, it should add `work.dedupKey` to `activeProject.rejectedDraftKeys` so re-running AI analysis on the same PDF does not recreate the deleted draft work.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **Previous 503 Error on `gemini-3.8-flash`**: Resolved in `server.ts` via retry + fallback to `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`. Preserved in our update to `server.ts`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - All component files (`Sidebar.tsx`, `Header.tsx`, `WorkTable.tsx`, `WorkDetailModal.tsx`, `AddWorkModal.tsx`, `AIAssistantModal.tsx`) and service files (`calculationEngine.ts`, `projectStorage.ts`, `server.ts`, `uscCatalog.ts`, `types/index.ts`) are updated and ready to be connected in `/src/App.tsx`.\n\n6. **Next Steps (In Immediate Priority Order)**\n   1. **View and Update `/src/App.tsx` and `/src/services/excelExport.ts`**:\n      - First call `view_file` on `/src/App.tsx` and `/src/services/excelExport.ts`.\n      - In `/src/App.tsx`:\n        - Add state `isSidebarCollapsed` (initialized via `loadSidebarCollapsed()`, toggled with `saveSidebarCollapsed()`) and `isMobileMenuOpen` (`false`).\n        - Pass the new props to `<Sidebar />`, `<Header />`, `<WorkTable />`, `<AddWorkModal />`, and `<AIAssistantModal />`.\n        - Implement `handleAutoTakeoff` calling `applyAutoQuantityTakeoff(...)` from `src/services/projectStorage.ts` and updating the active project state + `localStorage`.\n        - Implement `handleApproveDraftWork(workId)` and `handleApproveAllReadyDrafts()`.\n        - Implement `handleAddRecommendationWork(catalogId, floorId, reason)` using `createProjectWorkFromCatalog` with `origin: \'ai\'`, `aiVerificationStatus: \'draft\'`.\n        - Update `handleDeleteWork(workId)` to remove the work without `window.confirm` (since `WorkTable.tsx` now shows a custom React modal) and append `workToDelete.dedupKey` to `rejectedDraftKeys` if `workToDelete.origin === \'ai\'`.\n        - In the bottom Recap Total Volume section of `App.tsx`, clearly display **Volume Terverifikasi (Final)** alongside a separate badge/summary for **Volume Draf AI (Menunggu Verifikasi)** when `summaries.draftWorksCount > 0`.\n      - In `/src/services/excelExport.ts`:\n        - Ensure exported sheets clearly mark unverified AI drafts and separate them from verified totals.\n   2. **Compile, Lint, and Verify**:\n      - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to ensure zero TypeScript or build errors.\n      - Restart dev server if `server.ts` needs reloading, and verify `/api/health` and `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions`.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - All UI text, validation messages, formula descriptions, and user guides MUST be in Bahasa Indonesia.\n   - Maintain the blue-and-white civil engineering dashboard design (`#173B73`, `#2563EB`, `#F7F9FC`, `#FFFFFF`).\n   - Strictly Quantity Takeoff (Volume) only \342\200\224 no prices, AHSP, RAB costs, or S-curves.\n</summary>"
