    thinking: "**Analyzing the Scope**\n\nI\'m currently focused on dissecting the user\'s prompt, specifically the \"Skill Check\" section. I\'ve pinpointed two key areas: the need for an AI capable of interpreting engineering drawings/PDFs using the `@google/genai` library, or directly through the Gemini endpoint, and the second task, `frontend-design` aspect. I am working to clarify what the user needs.\n\n\n"
