  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Multiple Additions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on expanding the functionality of `AddWorkModal.tsx`. It now only supports adding one work item at a time, using `handleSelectCatalogItem(item)`. The user in **BAGIAN G** wants to be able to add several jobs at once. I\'m exploring the implications of allowing multiple selections within the modal, and how best to present this to the user.\n\n\n**Implementing Multi-Select Feature**\n\nI\'m now implementing the multi-select features. I\'ve integrated job category display and a search function to help the user locate the work items. Checkboxes allow the selection of multiple jobs across different catalog categories, and a counter displays the number of selected items. I will soon add a \'Add X Jobs\' button to batch add jobs to the current floor group. I also intend to implement logic to prevent duplicate entries and show notifications for added and skipped jobs.\n\n\n**Refining Modal Interactions**\n\nI\'m now refining the multi-select interaction within `AddWorkModal`. Users can now cancel their selections before adding any work items. Also, the modal won\'t close automatically if any errors need fixing. I will be retaining the formulas and parameters from the catalog. Newly added jobs will require parameters before calculation.\n\n\n**Analyzing Duplicate Entry Handling**\n\nI\'m now focusing on handling duplicate work items. I\'m implementing logic to detect if an item with the same `catalogId` already exists on the floor. I\'ll provide clear feedback to the user, such as a success message like \"Berhasil menambahkan 4 pekerjaan ke Lantai 1,\" and, if applicable, a message indicating skipped items: \"X pekerjaan dilewati karena sudah ada pada lantai tersebut.\" I will differentiate instances or inform the user accordingly. I\'m also now shifting attention to the AI Assistant and Layout architecture.\n\n\n**Revising AI Assistant Layout**\n\nI\'m now revising the AI Assistant layout based on the desired layout changes. I\'m focusing on ensuring the PDF upload functionality (JPG, JPEG, PNG) is retained within the AI Assistant. I will keep the unit, scale, and target floor selections before analysis, alongside the \'Start Analysis\' button, process indicator, file status, and analysis results. I\'m removing the duplicate upload area and keeping Manual Input as an alternative, proportionally placed near the AI Assistant. Also, I\'ll add a button to view AI-generated jobs in the calculator after analysis. I\'m also removing the redundant AI Assistant panel.\n\n\n**Eliminating Panel Redundancy**\n\nI\'m removing the duplicate AI Assistant panel in `RightPanel.tsx` as requested, which will simplify the user interface. This panel duplication is no longer needed. The workspace layout will be improved by focusing on the \"Ringkasan Proyek\" and \"Ekspor Excel\" components. I\'m focusing on cleaning up the existing redundant sections. I\'m making sure that the workflow is smoother.\n\n\n**Integrating AI Assistant**\n\nI am now integrating the AI Assistant into the main workflow as per the instructions in Section A. I have retained the PDF upload (JPG, JPEG, PNG) and other settings (unit, scale, target floor) within the assistant. The \'Start Analysis\' button, process indicator, file status, and results are all still present. I\'ve consolidated the upload process by removing the duplicate upload area and properly positioning the manual input. I\'m also adding a button to directly view AI-generated jobs in the calculator, as requested.\n\n\n**Designing AI Takeoff Section**\n\nI\'m now designing `AITakeoffSection.tsx` (or `AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx`). It will be a dedicated component on the page, above the job list. I\'m focusing on the Hero Title with sparkles, a status badge, and a subtitle describing the AI functionality. The layout will be a side-by-side or seamless integration. The left area will be around 75-80% of the space and will include a pre-analysis configuration bar with image units (mm, cm, m) and scale options (1:100, 1:20, 1:5).\n\n\n**Developing AI Takeoff Configuration**\n\nI\'m now developing the AI Takeoff configuration section. I\'ve integrated a scale selection with options like 1:75, 1:150, 1:200, and \'Other,\' alongside a \'Target Floor\' dropdown, which lists available floors. The drag-and-drop upload zone accepts PDF, JPG, JPEG, PNG, and WEBP files (up to 15MB) and displays file previews. A quick-access button lets users load a bundled floor plan example. I\'ve also incorporated a \"Start AI Analysis & Auto Takeoff\" button that triggers analysis via `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions`, and a progress indicator that shows the analysis steps: document upload, dimension reading, building element identification, job catalog matching, and job draft compilation.\n\n\n**Finalizing Analysis Display**\n\nI\'m now finalizing the display of AI analysis results. Upon analysis completion, I\'ll show a summary banner, such as \"Analisis Selesai: Ditemukan X parameter dimensi, Y draf pekerjaan baru berhasil disusun di [Nama Lantai].\" A prominent \"Lihat Pekerjaan Hasil AI di Kalkulator\" button will smoothly scroll to the Work Table, highlighting or filtering the AI drafts. \"Buka Rincian Analisis & Rekomendasi Lanjutan\" will either open a modal or expand a table, and there will be an \"Analisis Dokumen Lain\" button for a fresh start. Alongside the AI Assistant, there will be a manual input section with a \"Tambah pekerjaan dari katalog dan isi parameter dimensi secara manual tanpa AI\" button.\n\n\n**Diagnosing JSON Parsing Errors**\n\nI\'m now diagnosing the root causes of the JSON parsing errors I\'ve encountered when calling `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions`. I\'m focusing on three primary scenarios: issues with Express during JSON body parsing due to oversized or malformed requests; interruptions in the development server or proxying that result in Vite\'s `index.html` being served instead; and improper client-side handling of responses. I\'m carefully checking the potential of each scenario. I intend to thoroughly review the code, to prevent such errors.\n\n\n**Addressing Server Side Issues**\n\nI\'m now focusing on addressing the server-side issues that are causing the JSON parsing errors. I\'ve pinpointed that oversized or malformed requests are a likely culprit. I\'m implementing an error handling middleware in `server.ts` to explicitly catch `SyntaxError` and `entity.too.large` errors from Express, ensuring appropriate responses to the client. I\'m also confirming that API routes consistently return JSON responses with proper status codes and content type headers.\n\n\n**Fixing Response Handling**\n\nI\'m now implementing robust response handling to address JSON parsing errors. I\'m focusing on improved error management within the frontend `fetch` calls. I\'ve integrated a check for the `Content-Type` header, and I\'ll attempt parsing JSON only when appropriate. Also, I\'m providing meaningful error messages and ensuring the application can gracefully handle non-JSON responses. Finally, I\'m logging any parsing errors.\n\n\n**Optimizing Gemini Interactions**\n\nI\'m now optimizing the Gemini call for improved performance and error handling. I\'m focusing on ensuring the Base64 strings for PDFs and images are clean and correctly formatted. I will implement a model fallback mechanism, first using `gemini-3.8-flash` and then `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, both of which support PDF/images and JSON schemas. I\'m also adding a timeout/abort controller to prevent requests from hanging indefinitely, alongside user-friendly messages for different status codes.\n\n\n**Reviewing Performance Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now implementing the performance enhancements discussed in Section C, such as caching to prevent re-uploading identical files and structuring my prompts. I\'m also ensuring the progress steps for the AI analysis are accurate. I\'m reviewing Section D and E for the Auto Quantity Takeoff specifications for consistent units. I\'m meticulously incorporating dimension calculations from various supported works.\n\n\n**Refining Multi-Add Functionality**\n\nI\'m now refining the multi-add feature based on sections F and G. I\'ve ensured a consistent \"+ Tambah Pekerjaan\" button for each floor, both within the floor header and at the bottom of the rows. The `AddWorkModal` now correctly receives and sets the `defaultFloorId`, showing the floor name clearly. Checkboxes are now integrated for multi-selection, and a dynamic bottom bar updates with the selection count, providing \"Batalkan Pilihan\" and a button to add selected items to the specific floor, preventing duplicate work items. I\'m also ensuring informative notifications.\n\n\n**Verifying Final Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now verifying the final enhancements and integrating them, as requested in sections H, I, J, and K. I\'ve renamed \"Katalog USC\" to \"Katalog Pekerjaan,\" and the UI is free of raw Excel references. Approved works are now separated from drafts. The Excel export has four sheets, and I\'ve ensured a smooth transition. I\'m focusing on the `/server.ts` and `/src/components/AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx` files. I will make the requested modifications, including adding error middleware for JSON parsing, and creating a new Hero AI Assistant section.\n\n\n**Refining AI Analysis Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating the manual input card alongside the side AI assistant, ensuring the dimensions and units in the Auto Quantity Takeoff (AQT) align with the other sections. I\'ve focused on ensuring the AQT creates draft works directly in the active project. I\'ve updated the WorkTable to have dedicated \"+ Tambah Pekerjaan\" buttons in the floor headers and row additions. Now I am finalizing the UI, as described in the requirements.\n\n\n**Finalizing User Experience**\n\nI\'m now finalizing the user experience. I\'ve focused on integrating the multi-select feature in the `AddWorkModal` and updating the floor table and RightPanel. I\'ve updated the `Katalog USC` name to `Katalog Pekerjaan` and removed the duplicate AI card. I\'ve streamlined the workflow by integrating a section for adding work items. Also, I\'m integrating the auto quantity takeoff section and ensuring the dimensions are aligned.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_832978"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * RuangRAB - Server Backend\\n * Express API server with Vite middleware integration, server-side Gemini API,\\n * exponential backoff retry with jitter, robust error handling, and model fallback.\\n */\\n\\nimport express, { Request, Response, NextFunction } from \'express\';\\nimport { createServer as createViteServer } from \'vite\';\\nimport { GoogleGenAI, Type } from \'@google/genai\';\\nimport path from \'path\';\\nimport dotenv from \'dotenv\';\\n\\ndotenv.config();\\n\\nconst app = express();\\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT ? parseInt(process.env.PORT, 10) : 3000;\\nconst isProd = process.env.NODE_ENV === \'production\';\\n\\n// Support civil engineering high-resolution drawing PDFs & CAD image uploads (up to 50MB)\\napp.use(express.json({ limit: \'50mb\' }));\\napp.use(express.urlencoded({ extended: true, limit: \'50mb\' }));\\n\\n// Middleware to catch JSON parsing and payload size errors before they return HTML\\napp.use((err: any, req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction): void => {\\n  if (err) {\\n    console.error(\'[RuangRAB Server Middleware Error]:\', err);\\n    res.setHeader(\'Content-Type\', \'application/json\');\\n    if (err.type === \'entity.too.large\') {\\n      res.status(413).json({\\n        success: false,\\n        error: \'Ukuran file dokumen terlalu besar. Harap unggah file di bawah 15 MB.\',\\n      });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    res.status(err.status || 400).json({\\n      success: false,\\n      error: err.message || \'Format data permintaan tidak valid.\',\\n    });\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  next();\\n});\\n\\n// Health check endpoint\\napp.get(\'/api/health\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  res.setHeader(\'Content-Type\', \'application/json\');\\n  res.json({\\n    status: \'ok\',\\n    appName: \'RuangRAB\',\\n    version: \'1.2.0\',\\n    hasGeminiKey: Boolean(process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY),\\n  });\\n});\\n\\n/**\\n * Helper function: delay with exponential backoff & jitter\\n */\\nfunction wait(ms: number): Promise<void> {\\n  return new Promise((resolve) => setTimeout(resolve, ms));\\n}\\n\\nfunction isRetryableError(err: any): boolean {\\n  if (!err) return false;\\n  const status = err.status || err.code || err.statusCode;\\n  const message = String(err.message || \'\');\\n\\n  // 503 Service Unavailable / 429 Rate Limit / Transient network errors\\n  if (status === 503 || status === 429) return true;\\n  if (message.includes(\'503\') || message.includes(\'UNAVAILABLE\') || message.includes(\'high demand\')) return true;\\n  if (message.includes(\'429\') || message.includes(\'RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\')) return true;\\n  if (message.includes(\'ECONNRESET\') || message.includes(\'ETIMEDOUT\') || message.includes(\'fetch failed\')) return true;\\n\\n  // Non-retryable: 400 Bad Request, 401 Unauthorized, 403 Forbidden\\n  if (status === 400 || status === 401 || status === 403) return false;\\n  if (message.includes(\'API_KEY_INVALID\') || message.includes(\'PERMISSION_DENIED\')) return false;\\n\\n  return false;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Endpoint Ekstraksi Parameter Dimensi dari Gambar / PDF menggunakan Gemini API\\n * Dilengkapi Exponential Backoff, Jitter, dan Fast Model Fallback\\n */\\napp.post(\'/api/gemini/extract-dimensions\', async (req: Request, res: Response): Promise<void> => {\\n  res.setHeader(\'Content-Type\', \'application/json\');\\n\\n  try {\\n    const { fileBase64, mimeType, fileName, floorName, unitSetting, scaleSetting } = req.body;\\n\\n    if (!fileBase64 || !mimeType) {\\n      res.status(400).json({\\n        success: false,\\n        error: \'Data file gambar atau dokumen PDF (base64) tidak ditemukan.\',\\n      });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY) {\\n      res.status(503).json({\\n        success: false,\\n        error: \'GEMINI_API_KEY belum dikonfigurasi pada environment server.\',\\n      });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    const ai = new GoogleGenAI({\\n      apiKey: process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY,\\n      httpOptions: {\\n        headers: {\\n          \'User-Agent\': \'aistudio-build\',\\n        },\\n      },\\n    });\\n\\n    const chosenUnit = unitSetting || \'cm\';\\n    const chosenScale = scaleSetting || \'1:100\';\\n\\n    const systemInstruction = `\\nAnda adalah Senior Civil Engineering Quantity Surveyor RuangRAB yang sangat teliti.\\nTugas Anda membaca gambar teknik denah/potongan konstruksi (PDF/gambar) dan mengekstrak dimensi serta parameter kuantitas pekerjaan secara akurat untuk Auto Quantity Takeoff.\\n\\nATURAN UTAMA TEKNIK SIPIL:\\n1. BACA ANGKA DIMENSI TERTULIS PADA GAMBAR (contoh: 600, 300, 150, 1270, 200, 170, 100, 37).\\n2. Simpan nilai angka dimensi asli pada field \\\"rawExtractedValue\\\" (contoh: 600, 300, 150, 1270). JANGAN SEKALI-KALI mengalikan angka tertulis dengan faktor skala!\\n3. Jika pada gambar angka tertulis tanpa satuan eksplisit, gunakan satuan default yang dipilih pengguna: \\\"${chosenUnit}\\\". Namun jika parameter tersebut berupa Luas hasil akumulasi ruang (m\302\262) atau Jumlah titik/unit, isi \\\"detectedUnit\\\" dengan \\\"m\302\262\\\" atau \\\"unit\\\" sesuai konteksnya.\\n4. Identifikasi jenis gambar pada field \\\"drawingType\\\":\\n   - \\\"arsitektur_denah\\\" jika berupa denah lantai/ruang arsitektur\\n   - \\\"struktur_denah\\\" jika berupa rencana pondasi/kolom/sloof/balok/pelat\\n   - \\\"potongan_detail\\\" jika berupa gambar potongan/tampak yang memuat tinggi dinding/elevasi atap\\n   - \\\"lainnya\\\" untuk gambar lainnya\\n5. Identifikasi dimensi total bangunan (Panjang Total dan Lebar Total) berdasarkan batas garis as/grid terjauh.\\n6. Identifikasi nama ruang, elevasi lantai (FFL), dimensi grid ruangan (misal: R.Tamu, R.Makan, Dapur, KM/WC, Teras, Taman).\\n7. Catat lokasi as/grid secara spesifik pada field \\\"pageOrLocation\\\" (contoh: \\\"As A-D\\\", \\\"As 1-9\\\", \\\"As 6-8\\\", \\\"As 4-5\\\").\\n8. Petakan parameter ke \\\"catalogId\\\" dan \\\"parameterId\\\" katalog RuangRAB berikut HANYA JIKA didukung bukti nyata pada gambar:\\n   - catalogId: \\\"prep-pembersihan-lahan\\\" -> parameterId: \\\"panjang\\\" dan \\\"lebar\\\" (dari dimensi total bangunan/lahan)\\n   - catalogId: \\\"prep-bouwplank\\\" -> parameterId: \\\"panjang\\\" dan \\\"lebar\\\" (dari dimensi total bangunan)\\n   - catalogId: \\\"ars-dinding-bata-hebel\\\" -> parameterId: \\\"panjang_keliling\\\" (estimasi total panjang garis dinding pada denah dalam satuan gambar, atau \\\"tinggi_dinding\\\" HANYA jika gambar potongan/tampak mencantumkan tinggi dinding)\\n   - catalogId: \\\"ars-homogenous-tile-60x60\\\" -> parameterId: \\\"luas_lantai\\\" (total luas bersih ruang utama dalam m\302\262, detectedUnit: \\\"m\302\262\\\")\\n   - catalogId: \\\"ars-keramik-toilet-antislip\\\" -> parameterId: \\\"luas_total_toilet\\\" (luas ruang KM/WC dalam m\302\262, detectedUnit: \\\"m\302\262\\\")\\n   - catalogId: \\\"str-kolom-k1-beton\\\" atau \\\"str-kolom-k2-beton\\\" -> parameterId: \\\"lebar\\\", \\\"tebal\\\", \\\"tinggi\\\", \\\"jumlah\\\" (HANYA jika jumlah/dimensi kolom tertera jelas)\\n   - catalogId: \\\"str-balok-b1-beton\\\" -> parameterId: \\\"panjang_total\\\", \\\"lebar\\\", \\\"tinggi\\\" (HANYA jika denah balok/struktur tertera)\\n   - Untuk dimensi per ruang individual (misal Lebar Ruang Tamu, Panjang Kamar, dsb), tetap sertakan dalam daftar items sebagai rincian dimensi ruang yang terbaca.\\n9. JANGAN MENGARANG dimensi yang tidak terlihat pada gambar (contoh: jangan mengarang tinggi dinding pada gambar denah lantai datar).\\n10. Kembalikan JSON terstruktur sesuai responseSchema.\\n`;\\n\\n    const userPrompt = `\\nDokumen yang dianalisis: ${fileName || \'Dokumen Denah\'}\\nTarget Lantai: ${floorName || \'Lantai 1\'}\\nSatuan dimensi gambar yang dipilih pengguna: ${chosenUnit}\\nSkala tertera: ${chosenScale}\\n\\nLakukan pembacaan lengkap untuk Auto Quantity Takeoff:\\n1. Ekstrak judul denah, jenis gambar (drawingType), dan skala tertera pada gambar.\\n2. Ekstrak dimensi total bangunan (Lebar total dan Panjang total dari garis dimensi terluar) untuk Pembersihan Lahan dan Bouwplank.\\n3. Ekstrak dimensi ruang-ruang utama (R. Tamu, R. Makan, Dapur, KM/WC, Teras, Taman, dll.) beserta lokasi grid/as-nya.\\n4. Hitung juga parameter terpetakan untuk pekerjaan yang relevan dengan bukti gambar (seperti panjang_keliling dinding dari segmen dinding denah, luas_lantai ruang utama dalam m\302\262, dan luas_total_toilet KM/WC dalam m\302\262).\\n`;\\n\\n    // Remove data URL header if present in base64 string\\n    const cleanBase64 = fileBase64.replace(/^data:[^;]+;base64,/, \'\');\\n\\n    const documentPart = {\\n      inlineData: {\\n        mimeType: mimeType,\\n        data: cleanBase64,\\n      },\\n    };\\n\\n    const textPart = {\\n      text: userPrompt,\\n    };\\n\\n    // Sequential fallback order: try primary first; on 503/load switch immediately to fallback\\n    const plannedAttempts = [\\n      { model: \'gemini-3.8-flash\', label: \'Primary (gemini-3.8-flash)\' },\\n      { model: \'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\', label: \'Fallback 1 (gemini-3.1-flash-lite)\' },\\n      { model: \'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\', label: \'Fallback 2 with Backoff (gemini-3.1-flash-lite)\' },\\n    ];\\n\\n    let lastError: any = null;\\n    let successfulResponseText: string | null = null;\\n    let modelUsed = \'\';\\n\\n    for (let i = 0; i < plannedAttempts.length; i++) {\\n      const { model, label } = plannedAttempts[i];\\n      const attemptNum = i + 1;\\n\\n      try {\\n        console.log(`[RuangRAB AI] Attempt ${attemptNum}/3: Invoking ${label}...`);\\n\\n        const response = await ai.models.generateContent({\\n          model,\\n          contents: { parts: [documentPart, textPart] },\\n          config: {\\n            systemInstruction,\\n            responseMimeType: \'application/json\',\\n            responseSchema: {\\n              type: Type.OBJECT,\\n              properties: {\\n                documentSummary: {\\n                  type: Type.STRING,\\n                  description: \'Ringkasan singkat gambar (judul denah, jenis gambar, skala, elevasi FFL).\',\\n                },\\n                drawingType: {\\n                  type: Type.STRING,\\n                  description: \'Jenis gambar: arsitektur_denah, struktur_denah, potongan_detail, atau lainnya.\',\\n                },\\n                identifiedFloor: {\\n                  type: Type.STRING,\\n                  description: \'Nama lantai yang tertera (misal: Lantai 1, Lantai 2).\',\\n                },\\n                identifiedScale: {\\n                  type: Type.STRING,\\n                  description: \'Skala yang tertera pada etiket (misal: 1:100).\',\\n                },\\n                items: {\\n                  type: Type.ARRAY,\\n                  description: \'Daftar parameter dimensi dan kuantitas pekerjaan yang terbaca.\',\\n                  items: {\\n                    type: Type.OBJECT,\\n                    properties: {\\n                      targetCategory: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'Kategori: Persiapan Dll, Struktural, Arsitektural, atau MEP.\',\\n                      },\\n                      suggestedWorkName: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'Nama pekerjaan yang relevan (misal: Pembersihan Lahan, Pekerjaan Bouwplank & Pengukuran, Pemasangan Dinding Bata Ringan (Hebel), Pemasangan Homogenous Tile 60 x 60 cm, Pemasangan Keramik Lantai Toilet 40 x 40 cm Anti-Slip).\',\\n                      },\\n                      catalogId: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'ID katalog RuangRAB jika cocok langsung (misal: prep-pembersihan-lahan, prep-bouwplank, ars-dinding-bata-hebel, ars-homogenous-tile-60x60, ars-keramik-toilet-antislip, str-kolom-k1-beton, str-balok-b1-beton). Kosongkan jika hanya dimensi ruang informatif.\',\\n                      },\\n                      parameterId: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'ID parameter katalog (misal: panjang, lebar, panjang_keliling, tinggi_dinding, luas_lantai, luas_total_toilet, panjang_total, jumlah).\',\\n                      },\\n                      parameterName: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'Nama parameter yang mudah dibaca (Panjang, Lebar, Panjang Keliling Dinding, Luas Bersih Area HT, Luas Total Lantai Toilet, dsb).\',\\n                      },\\n                      rawExtractedValue: {\\n                        type: Type.NUMBER,\\n                        description: \'Angka asli yang tertulis pada gambar tanpa perkalian skala (misal: 600, 300, 150, 1270).\',\\n                      },\\n                      detectedUnit: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'Satuan yang tertera atau default pengguna (mm, cm, m, m\302\262, unit).\',\\n                      },\\n                      confidence: {\\n                        type: Type.NUMBER,\\n                        description: \'Tingkat keyakinan pembacaan antara 0.0 sampai 1.0.\',\\n                      },\\n                      pageOrLocation: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'Garis as atau lokasi pada denah (misal: As A-D, As 1-9, Ruang Tamu, KM/WC).\',\\n                      },\\n                      notes: {\\n                        type: Type.STRING,\\n                        description: \'Keterangan teknis pembacaan atau rincian asal angka.\',\\n                      },\\n                    },\\n                    required: [\\n                      \'targetCategory\',\\n                      \'suggestedWorkName\',\\n                      \'parameterName\',\\n                      \'rawExtractedValue\',\\n                    ],\\n                  },\\n                },\\n              },\\n              required: [\'documentSummary\', \'items\'],\\n            },\\n          },\\n        });\\n\\n        successfulResponseText = response.text || \'{}\';\\n        modelUsed = model;\\n        console.log(`[RuangRAB AI] Success on attempt ${attemptNum} with model: ${model}`);\\n        break;\\n      } catch (err: any) {\\n        lastError = err;\\n        console.warn(`[RuangRAB AI] Attempt ${attemptNum} failed with error:`, err?.status || err?.code || \'\', err?.message || err);\\n\\n        if (!isRetryableError(err)) {\\n          // Fatal error (bad request, auth error); do not retry\\n          console.error(\'[RuangRAB AI] Non-retryable error, aborting attempts.\');\\n          break;\\n        }\\n\\n        if (i < plannedAttempts.length - 1) {\\n          // Calculate exponential backoff with jitter\\n          const jitter = Math.floor(Math.random() * 400);\\n          const backoffMs = 1000 + i * 1000 + jitter;\\n          console.log(`[RuangRAB AI] Waiting ${backoffMs}ms before fallback/retry attempt ${attemptNum + 1}...`);\\n          await wait(backoffMs);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!successfulResponseText) {\\n      console.error(\'[RuangRAB AI] All attempts failed. Last error:\', lastError?.message || lastError);\\n\\n      res.status(503).json({\\n        success: false,\\n        isBusy: true,\\n        error: \'Layanan AI sedang mengalami beban tinggi (503). Dokumen belum berhasil dianalisis. Silakan coba kembali beberapa saat lagi.\',\\n        technicalDetail: lastError?.message ? String(lastError.message).slice(0, 200) : \'Layanan AI mengalami beban tinggi.\',\\n      });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    let parsedData: any;\\n    try {\\n      parsedData = JSON.parse(successfulResponseText);\\n    } catch (parseErr) {\\n      console.error(\'[RuangRAB AI] Failed to parse model output as JSON:\', parseErr, successfulResponseText.slice(0, 300));\\n      res.status(500).json({\\n        success: false,\\n        error: \'Format keluaran model AI tidak valid. Silakan coba analisis ulang.\',\\n      });\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    res.json({\\n      success: true,\\n      modelUsed,\\n      data: parsedData,\\n    });\\n  } catch (error: unknown) {\\n    console.error(\'[RuangRAB AI] Server unexpected error:\', error);\\n    const errorMsg = error instanceof Error ? error.message : String(error);\\n    res.status(500).json({\\n      success: false,\\n      error: `Gagal membaca gambar dengan AI: ${errorMsg}`,\\n    });\\n  }\\n});\\n\\n// Setup Vite development middlewares or static files for production\\nasync function startServer() {\\n  if (!isProd) {\\n    const vite = await createViteServer({\\n      server: { middlewareMode: true },\\n      appType: \'spa\',\\n    });\\n    app.use(vite.middlewares);\\n  } else {\\n    const distPath = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \'dist\');\\n    app.use(express.static(distPath));\\n    app.get(\'*\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n      res.sendFile(path.resolve(distPath, \'index.html\'));\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  app.listen(PORT, \'0.0.0.0\', () => {\\n    console.log(`RuangRAB server running on http://0.0.0.0:${PORT}`);\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nstartServer();\\n\", \"Description\":\"Ensure JSON error middleware and explicit JSON response headers in server.ts to prevent HTML errors from reaching clients as invalid JSON\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating server.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update server.ts\"}"
