  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Unified Component**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx` component. I\'m carefully reviewing the user\'s requirements from sections A through E of the prompt. My main objective is to replace the separate \"Unggah Gambar / PDF\" card at the top with this new component, which will be the primary section.\n\n\n**Designing Input Controls**\n\nI\'m now designing the input controls that will sit above the work table, right next to the \"Input Manual\" card. I\'m focusing on providing options for selecting the unit (mm, cm, m), scale (including a \"Lainnya\" and \"Tidak diketahui\" option), and the target floor from the project\'s existing floors. I\'m also finalizing the file upload functionality for PDFs and images, with drag-and-drop, status indicators, and a remove button. I\'ve included a quick button to load a sample USC floor plan.\n\n\n**Implementing Post-Analysis Actions**\n\nI\'m now implementing the post-analysis actions. Upon successful AI analysis, I will automatically execute `onAutoTakeoff`, generating AI draft work items for the target floor. I plan to display a results summary banner with extracted dimensions, created drafts, and updated work items. I\'m also implementing a smooth scroll and filter to the Work Table, with options to \"Lihat Rincian Analisis (Modal)\" and \"Analisis Dokumen Baru\". I\'m implementing the \"Input Manual\" card next, for entering building data and parameters manually.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_101691"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * RuangRAB \342\200\224 Asisten AI Auto Quantity Takeoff & Input Manual Section\\n * Menggabungkan fungsi pembacaan gambar teknik AI langsung di atas daftar pekerjaan,\\n * dilengkapi pengaturan satuan, skala, lantai target, indikator progres bertahap,\\n * dan penanganan error respons non-JSON yang aman.\\n */\\n\\nimport React, { useState, useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Sparkles,\\n  UploadCloud,\\n  FileText,\\n  Layers,\\n  Ruler,\\n  Sliders,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  AlertCircle,\\n  Loader2,\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  Check,\\n  FileEdit,\\n  X,\\n  ExternalLink,\\n  ChevronDown,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport {\\n  AIAutoTakeoffSummary,\\n  AIExtractionItem,\\n  DrawingScale,\\n  DrawingUnit,\\n  FloorItem,\\n  ProjectWorkItem,\\n} from \'../types\';\\n\\ninterface AutoQuantityTakeoffSectionProps {\\n  floors: FloorItem[];\\n  activeFloorId: string;\\n  onAutoTakeoff: (\\n    items: AIExtractionItem[],\\n    targetFloorId: string,\\n    sourceDocument: string,\\n    meta?: {\\n      documentSummary?: string;\\n      drawingType?: \'arsitektur_denah\' | \'struktur_denah\' | \'potongan_detail\' | \'lainnya\';\\n      identifiedFloor?: string;\\n      identifiedScale?: string;\\n      forceIncludeRejected?: boolean;\\n    }\\n  ) => {\\n    summary: AIAutoTakeoffSummary;\\n    affectedWorks: ProjectWorkItem[];\\n  };\\n  onOpenManualForm: (floorId: string) => void;\\n  onOpenDetailedModal: () => void;\\n  onFilterDrafts?: () => void;\\n  existingWorks: ProjectWorkItem[];\\n}\\n\\nexport const AutoQuantityTakeoffSection: React.FC<AutoQuantityTakeoffSectionProps> = ({\\n  floors,\\n  activeFloorId,\\n  onAutoTakeoff,\\n  onOpenManualForm,\\n  onOpenDetailedModal,\\n  onFilterDrafts,\\n}) => {\\n  // Pre-Analysis Configuration\\n  const [selectedFloorId, setSelectedFloorId] = useState<string>(\\n    activeFloorId || floors[1]?.id || \'fl-1\'\\n  );\\n  const [selectedUnit, setSelectedUnit] = useState<DrawingUnit>(\'cm\');\\n  const [selectedScale, setSelectedScale] = useState<DrawingScale>(\'1:100\');\\n  const [customScaleDenom, setCustomScaleDenom] = useState<number>(100);\\n\\n  // File Upload State\\n  const [selectedFile, setSelectedFile] = useState<File | null>(null);\\n  const [fileError, setFileError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const fileInputRef = useRef<HTMLInputElement>(null);\\n\\n  // AI Analysis Execution State\\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [analysisStep, setAnalysisStep] = useState<number>(0);\\n  const [analysisError, setAnalysisError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const [isServerBusy, setIsServerBusy] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n  const [lastSummary, setLastSummary] = useState<AIAutoTakeoffSummary | null>(null);\\n  const [modelUsedInfo, setModelUsedInfo] = useState<string>(\'\');\\n\\n  const scaleOptions: { label: string; value: DrawingScale }[] = [\\n    { label: \'1:100 (Standar)\', value: \'1:100\' },\\n    { label: \'1:50 (Detail)\', value: \'1:50\' },\\n    { label: \'1:75\', value: \'1:75\' },\\n    { label: \'1:20 (Detail Khusus)\', value: \'1:20\' },\\n    { label: \'1:150\', value: \'1:150\' },\\n    { label: \'1:200 (Siteplan)\', value: \'1:200\' },\\n    { label: \'Lainnya (Kustom)\', value: \'custom\' },\\n    { label: \'Tidak Diketahui\', value: \'unknown\' },\\n  ];\\n\\n  const analysisStepsLabels = [\\n    \'Mengunggah & memverifikasi dokumen gambar...\',\\n    \'Membaca angka dimensi tertulis pada denah...\',\\n    \'Mengidentifikasi elemen struktur & arsitektur...\',\\n    \'Mencocokkan parameter dengan katalog pekerjaan...\',\\n    \'Menyusun draf pekerjaan ke kalkulator volume...\',\\n  ];\\n\\n  const computeConvertedValue = (\\n    rawVal: number,\\n    unit: DrawingUnit,\\n    explicitUnit?: string\\n  ): { value: number; convertedUnit: string } => {\\n    if (explicitUnit && (explicitUnit.includes(\'m\302\262\') || explicitUnit.includes(\'m2\'))) {\\n      return { value: Number(rawVal.toFixed(2)), convertedUnit: \'m\302\262\' };\\n    }\\n    if (explicitUnit && (explicitUnit.includes(\'buah\') || explicitUnit.includes(\'unit\') || explicitUnit.includes(\'titik\'))) {\\n      return { value: Math.round(rawVal), convertedUnit: \'unit\' };\\n    }\\n\\n    let valInMeter = rawVal;\\n    if (unit === \'mm\') {\\n      valInMeter = rawVal / 1000;\\n    } else if (unit === \'cm\') {\\n      valInMeter = rawVal / 100;\\n    } else {\\n      valInMeter = rawVal;\\n    }\\n\\n    return {\\n      value: Number(valInMeter.toFixed(3)),\\n      convertedUnit: \'m\',\\n    };\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleFileDrop = (e: React.DragEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (isLoading) return;\\n    if (e.dataTransfer.files && e.dataTransfer.files[0]) {\\n      handleValidateAndSetFile(e.dataTransfer.files[0]);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleFileInputChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => {\\n    if (e.target.files && e.target.files[0]) {\\n      handleValidateAndSetFile(e.target.files[0]);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleValidateAndSetFile = (file: File) => {\\n    setFileError(null);\\n    setAnalysisError(null);\\n    setLastSummary(null);\\n\\n    const validTypes = [\\n      \'application/pdf\',\\n      \'image/png\',\\n      \'image/jpeg\',\\n      \'image/jpg\',\\n      \'image/webp\',\\n    ];\\n\\n    if (!validTypes.includes(file.type) && !file.name.match(/\\\\.(pdf|png|jpe?g|webp)$/i)) {\\n      setFileError(\'Format file tidak didukung. Harap unggah file PDF, JPG, atau PNG.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (file.size > 20 * 1024 * 1024) {\\n      setFileError(\'Ukuran file melebihi batas maksimal 20 MB.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setSelectedFile(file);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleLoadSamplePdf = async () => {\\n    try {\\n      setFileError(null);\\n      setAnalysisError(null);\\n      setLastSummary(null);\\n      const res = await fetch(\'/assets/aistudio/rencana_1-Model_2ceb7bed.pdf\');\\n      if (!res.ok) throw new Error(\'File contoh tidak ditemukan.\');\\n      const blob = await res.blob();\\n      const sampleFile = new File([blob], \'rencana 1-Model.pdf\', { type: \'application/pdf\' });\\n      setSelectedFile(sampleFile);\\n    } catch {\\n      setFileError(\'Gagal memuat dokumen contoh. Anda dapat mengunggah file PDF lokal sendiri.\');\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleStartAnalysis = async () => {\\n    if (!selectedFile) {\\n      setFileError(\'Pilih file gambar atau dokumen PDF terlebih dahulu.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setIsLoading(true);\\n    setAnalysisStep(0);\\n    setAnalysisError(null);\\n    setIsServerBusy(false);\\n    setLastSummary(null);\\n\\n    const stepTimer = setInterval(() => {\\n      setAnalysisStep((prev) => (prev < 4 ? prev + 1 : prev));\\n    }, 1400);\\n\\n    try {\\n      const base64Data = await new Promise<string>((resolve, reject) => {\\n        const reader = new FileReader();\\n        reader.onload = () => resolve(reader.result as string);\\n        reader.onerror = (err) => reject(err);\\n        reader.readAsDataURL(selectedFile);\\n      });\\n\\n      const targetFloorObj = floors.find((f) => f.id === selectedFloorId);\\n      const scaleText =\\n        selectedScale === \'custom\'\\n          ? `1:${customScaleDenom}`\\n          : selectedScale === \'unknown\'\\n          ? \'Tidak Diketahui\'\\n          : selectedScale;\\n\\n      const response = await fetch(\'/api/gemini/extract-dimensions\', {\\n        method: \'POST\',\\n        headers: { \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\' },\\n        body: JSON.stringify({\\n          fileBase64: base64Data,\\n          mimeType: selectedFile.type || \'application/pdf\',\\n          fileName: selectedFile.name,\\n          floorName: targetFloorObj ? targetFloorObj.name : \'Lantai 1\',\\n          unitSetting: selectedUnit,\\n          scaleSetting: scaleText,\\n        }),\\n      });\\n\\n      const contentType = response.headers.get(\'content-type\') || \'\';\\n      let resJson: any = null;\\n\\n      if (contentType.includes(\'application/json\')) {\\n        try {\\n          resJson = await response.json();\\n        } catch (jsonErr) {\\n          console.error(\'[RuangRAB] Gagal parsing JSON respons:\', jsonErr);\\n        }\\n      } else {\\n        const rawText = await response.text();\\n        console.error(\\n          \'[RuangRAB] Server mengembalikan respons bukan JSON (status \' +\\n            response.status +\\n            \'):\',\\n          rawText.slice(0, 300)\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      clearInterval(stepTimer);\\n\\n      if (!response.ok || !resJson || !resJson.success) {\\n        if (response.status === 503 || resJson?.isBusy) {\\n          setIsServerBusy(true);\\n          setAnalysisError(\\n            \'Server AI sedang sibuk (503). Dokumen belum berhasil dianalisis. Silakan coba kembali beberapa saat lagi.\'\\n          );\\n        } else if (response.status === 413) {\\n          setAnalysisError(\\n            \'Ukuran file dokumen terlalu besar. Harap unggah file yang lebih ringkas (di bawah 15 MB).\'\\n          );\\n        } else if (resJson?.error) {\\n          setAnalysisError(resJson.error);\\n        } else {\\n          setAnalysisError(\\n            `Koneksi server gagal (Kode status: ${response.status}). Periksa koneksi atau coba beberapa saat lagi.`\\n          );\\n        }\\n        setIsLoading(false);\\n        return;\\n      }\\n\\n      const rawData = resJson.data;\\n      setModelUsedInfo(resJson.modelUsed || \'gemini-3.8-flash\');\\n\\n      if (Array.isArray(rawData.items) && rawData.items.length > 0) {\\n        const parsedItems: AIExtractionItem[] = rawData.items.map((item: any, idx: number) => {\\n          const id = `ai-item-${Date.now()}-${idx}`;\\n          const rawVal = Number(item.rawExtractedValue) || 0;\\n          const explicitUnit = item.detectedUnit;\\n          const { value: converted, convertedUnit } = computeConvertedValue(\\n            rawVal,\\n            selectedUnit,\\n            explicitUnit\\n          );\\n\\n          return {\\n            id,\\n            targetCategory: item.targetCategory || \'Arsitektural\',\\n            suggestedWorkName: item.suggestedWorkName || \'Pekerjaan Terdeteksi\',\\n            catalogId: item.catalogId,\\n            parameterId: item.parameterId,\\n            parameterName: item.parameterName || \'Dimensi\',\\n            rawExtractedValue: rawVal,\\n            rawUnit: selectedUnit,\\n            explicitUnitOnDrawing: explicitUnit,\\n            convertedValue: converted,\\n            convertedUnit,\\n            confidence: item.confidence ?? 0.95,\\n            sourceDocument: selectedFile.name,\\n            pageOrLocation: item.pageOrLocation || \'Denah\',\\n            notes: item.notes || \'Angka dimensi tertulis pada gambar.\',\\n            status: \'approved\',\\n          };\\n        });\\n\\n        // Jalankan Auto Quantity Takeoff langsung ke kalkulator sebagai Draf AI!\\n        const takeoffResult = onAutoTakeoff(parsedItems, selectedFloorId, selectedFile.name, {\\n          documentSummary: rawData.documentSummary || `Analisis ${selectedFile.name}`,\\n          drawingType: rawData.drawingType || \'arsitektur_denah\',\\n          identifiedFloor: rawData.identifiedFloor || targetFloorObj?.name || \'Lantai 1\',\\n          identifiedScale: rawData.identifiedScale || scaleText,\\n        });\\n\\n        setLastSummary(takeoffResult.summary);\\n      } else {\\n        setAnalysisError(\\n          \'AI tidak menemukan dimensi tertulis yang jelas pada gambar ini. Pastikan gambar memuat angka ukuran dimensi yang terbaca.\'\\n        );\\n      }\\n    } catch (err: unknown) {\\n      clearInterval(stepTimer);\\n      const msg = err instanceof Error ? err.message : String(err);\\n      console.error(\'[RuangRAB] Analysis exception:\', err);\\n      setAnalysisError(`Terjadi gangguan saat memproses gambar: ${msg}`);\\n    } finally {\\n      setIsLoading(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleScrollToWorkTable = () => {\\n    if (onFilterDrafts) {\\n      onFilterDrafts();\\n    }\\n    const el = document.getElementById(\'work-table-container\');\\n    if (el) {\\n      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: \'smooth\', block: \'start\' });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const targetFloor = floors.find((f) => f.id === selectedFloorId);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"mb-7 grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-stretch\\\">\\n      {/* 1. Primary AI Assistant Section (Left 8-9 cols) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"xl:col-span-8 2xl:col-span-9 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-blue-200/90 shadow-xs p-5 relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n        {/* Subtle background glow */}\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-80 h-80 bg-blue-50/60 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -mr-20 -mt-20\\\" />\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"relative z-10\\\">\\n          {/* Header Title & Badge */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2.5 pb-4 border-b border-slate-100\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs shrink-0\\\">\\n                <Sparkles className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              <div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight\\\">\\n                    Asisten AI \342\200\224 Auto Quantity Takeoff\\n                  </h3>\\n                  <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 tracking-wider\\\">\\n                    Gemini Argon\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5\\\">\\n                  Unggah denah/potongan (PDF/gambar). AI membaca dimensi tertulis dan langsung menyusun draf pekerjaan ke kalkulator.\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Quick Sample Button */}\\n            {!selectedFile && !isLoading && (\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={handleLoadSamplePdf}\\n                className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 hover:border-blue-400 bg-blue-50/50 hover:bg-blue-100/60 text-blue-700 text-xs font-semibold transition self-start sm:self-auto shrink-0\\\"\\n              >\\n                <FileText className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Gunakan Contoh Denah (USC)</span>\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Pre-Analysis Controls: Unit, Scale, Target Floor */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 my-4 bg-slate-50/70 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 text-xs\\\">\\n            {/* Setting 1: Satuan Gambar */}\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1.5\\\">\\n                <Ruler className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600\\\" />\\n                <span>Satuan Dimensi Gambar</span>\\n              </label>\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 p-1 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg\\\">\\n                {([\'mm\', \'cm\', \'m\'] as DrawingUnit[]).map((u) => (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={u}\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    disabled={isLoading}\\n                    onClick={() => setSelectedUnit(u)}\\n                    className={`py-1 text-center font-bold text-xs rounded transition ${\\n                      selectedUnit === u\\n                        ? \'bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-2xs\'\\n                        : \'text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    {u}\\n                  </button>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 block mt-1\\\">\\n                {selectedUnit === \'cm\'\\n                  ? \'Contoh: 300 di gambar -> 3.00 m\'\\n                  : selectedUnit === \'mm\'\\n                  ? \'Contoh: 3000 di gambar -> 3.00 m\'\\n                  : \'Contoh: 3 di gambar -> 3.00 m\'}\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Setting 2: Skala Gambar */}\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1.5\\\">\\n                <Sliders className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600\\\" />\\n                <span>Skala Tertera di Etiket</span>\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                disabled={isLoading}\\n                value={selectedScale}\\n                onChange={(e) => setSelectedScale(e.target.value as DrawingScale)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 font-semibold text-slate-900 bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\\\"\\n              >\\n                {scaleOptions.map((opt) => (\\n                  <option key={opt.value} value={opt.value}>\\n                    {opt.label}\\n                  </option>\\n                ))}\\n              </select>\\n              {selectedScale === \'custom\' && (\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono\\\">1 :</span>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"number\\\"\\n                    value={customScaleDenom}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setCustomScaleDenom(Number(e.target.value) || 100)}\\n                    className=\\\"w-20 px-2 py-0.5 border border-slate-300 rounded text-xs font-mono\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Setting 3: Lantai Target */}\\n            <div>\\n              <label className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-700 flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1.5\\\">\\n                <Layers className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-600\\\" />\\n                <span>Lantai Tujuan Auto Takeoff</span>\\n              </label>\\n              <select\\n                disabled={isLoading}\\n                value={selectedFloorId}\\n                onChange={(e) => setSelectedFloorId(e.target.value)}\\n                className=\\\"w-full px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 font-semibold text-slate-900 bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500\\\"\\n              >\\n                {floors.map((fl) => (\\n                  <option key={fl.id} value={fl.id}>\\n                    {fl.name} {fl.elevation ? `(${fl.elevation})` : \'\'}\\n                  </option>\\n                ))}\\n              </select>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 block mt-1\\\">\\n                Draf AI akan ditempatkan di {targetFloor?.name || \'lantai ini\'}.\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Upload Drop Zone & Selected File Card */}\\n          {!selectedFile ? (\\n            <div\\n              onDragOver={(e) => e.preventDefault()}\\n              onDrop={handleFileDrop}\\n              onClick={() => fileInputRef.current?.click()}\\n              className=\\\"border-2 border-dashed border-blue-200 hover:border-blue-400 bg-blue-50/25 hover:bg-blue-50/50 rounded-xl p-5 text-center cursor-pointer transition flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 group\\\"\\n            >\\n              <input\\n                ref={fileInputRef}\\n                type=\\\"file\\\"\\n                accept=\\\".pdf,image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp\\\"\\n                className=\\\"hidden\\\"\\n                onChange={handleFileInputChange}\\n              />\\n              <div className=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100/70 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-105 transition shadow-2xs\\\">\\n                <UploadCloud className=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" />\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"text-center\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-800 block\\\">\\n                  Klik untuk memilih file gambar/PDF denah atau seret ke sini\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 block mt-0.5\\\">\\n                  Format yang didukung: PDF, JPG, JPEG, PNG (Maksimal 20 MB)\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          ) : (\\n            <div className=\\\"p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50/40 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs shrink-0 shadow-2xs\\\">\\n                  {selectedFile.name.endsWith(\'.pdf\') ? \'PDF\' : \'IMG\'}\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"min-w-0\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs block truncate max-w-md\\\">\\n                    {selectedFile.name}\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono block\\\">\\n                    {(selectedFile.size / (1024 * 1024)).toFixed(2)} MB \302\267 Target:{\' \'}\\n                    <strong className=\\\"text-blue-700\\\">{targetFloor?.name}</strong>\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {!isLoading && (\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setSelectedFile(null);\\n                      setLastSummary(null);\\n                      setAnalysisError(null);\\n                    }}\\n                    className=\\\"p-1.5 text-slate-400 hover:text-rose-600 hover:bg-white rounded-lg transition\\\"\\n                    title=\\\"Ganti Dokumen\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  </button>\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={handleStartAnalysis}\\n                    className=\\\"px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-xs transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-xs\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <Sparkles className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>Mulai Analisis AI</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Validation or File Error */}\\n          {fileError && (\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-rose-700\\\">\\n              <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0\\\" />\\n              <span>{fileError}</span>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Active Process Steps Indicator */}\\n          {isLoading && (\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white space-y-3 animate-in fade-in duration-150\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <Loader2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-blue-400 animate-spin shrink-0\\\" />\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white\\\">\\n                    Sedang Membaca Dokumen dengan Gemini Argon...\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  Langkah {analysisStep + 1} dari 5\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-1.5 pt-1 border-t border-slate-800 text-[11px]\\\">\\n                {analysisStepsLabels.map((lbl, idx) => {\\n                  const isDone = analysisStep > idx;\\n                  const isCurrent = analysisStep === idx;\\n                  return (\\n                    <div\\n                      key={idx}\\n                      className={`flex items-center gap-2 transition-opacity ${\\n                        isDone\\n                          ? \'text-emerald-400\'\\n                          : isCurrent\\n                          ? \'text-blue-300 font-semibold\'\\n                          : \'text-slate-600\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      {isDone ? (\\n                        <Check className=\\\"w-3 h-3 text-emerald-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                      ) : isCurrent ? (\\n                        <div className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400 animate-pulse shrink-0\\\" />\\n                      ) : (\\n                        <div className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-700 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                      )}\\n                      <span>{lbl}</span>\\n                    </div>\\n                  );\\n                })}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Analysis Error & Retry Box */}\\n          {analysisError && !isLoading && (\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 space-y-2 text-xs\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-rose-800 font-semibold\\\">\\n                <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"flex-1\\\">\\n                  <span>{analysisError}</span>\\n                  {isServerBusy && (\\n                    <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-rose-600 font-normal mt-1 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                      Layanan AI menerima banyak permintaan serentak. Sistem kami dilengkapi retry otomatis dan model fallback. Silakan coba kembali dengan menekan tombol di bawah.\\n                    </p>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-1\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={handleStartAnalysis}\\n                  className=\\\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-700 text-white font-bold text-xs transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-2xs\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  <span>Coba Lagi</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Analysis Success Banner & Immediate Actions */}\\n          {lastSummary && !isLoading && (\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/90 border border-emerald-200 text-xs space-y-3 animate-in fade-in duration-200\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-2.5 border-b border-emerald-200/80\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-950 font-bold\\\">\\n                  <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                  <span>Auto Quantity Takeoff Selesai ({modelUsedInfo || \'gemini-3.8-flash\'})</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-emerald-800 font-medium\\\">\\n                  {lastSummary.documentSummary}\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-[11px]\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-white/80 p-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-slate-500 block\\\">Dimensi Terbaca:</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono text-xs\\\">\\n                    {lastSummary.extractedCount} nilai\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-white/80 p-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-slate-500 block\\\">Draf Pekerjaan Baru:</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-blue-700 font-mono text-xs\\\">\\n                    +{lastSummary.createdDraftWorksCount} draf\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-white/80 p-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-slate-500 block\\\">Pekerjaan Diperbarui:</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-indigo-700 font-mono text-xs\\\">\\n                    {lastSummary.updatedExistingWorksCount} item\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-white/80 p-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-slate-500 block\\\">Rekomendasi Lanjutan:</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold text-slate-800 font-mono text-xs\\\">\\n                    {lastSummary.recommendations.length} pekerjaan\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Action Buttons: Jump to Calculator & View Details */}\\n              <div className=\\\"pt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[11px] text-emerald-800\\\">\\n                  Draf AI sudah masuk ke daftar pekerjaan <strong>{targetFloor?.name}</strong>. Silakan periksa dan setujui untuk memasukkannya ke total volume final.\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={onOpenDetailedModal}\\n                    className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-300 bg-white hover:bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800 font-semibold text-xs transition flex items-center gap-1 shadow-2xs\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <ExternalLink className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                    <span>Rincian Ekstraksi ({lastSummary.extractedCount})</span>\\n                  </button>\\n\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={handleScrollToWorkTable}\\n                    className=\\\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold text-xs transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-xs\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <span>Lihat Pekerjaan Hasil AI di Kalkulator</span>\\n                    <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* 2. Proportional Input Manual Section (Right 3-4 cols) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"xl:col-span-4 2xl:col-span-3 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-5 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-slate-300 transition\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-2\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs shrink-0\\\">\\n              <FileEdit className=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <h3 className=\\\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight\\\">Input Manual</h3>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-medium\\\">Alternatif Tanpa AI</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n            Pilih pekerjaan dari katalog konstruksi standar dan masukkan dimensi parameter (panjang, lebar, tinggi, jumlah) secara mandiri.\\n          </p>\\n\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-4 p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 text-[11px] text-slate-600 space-y-1.5\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <span>Lantai Aktif:</span>\\n              <strong className=\\\"text-slate-900\\\">{targetFloor?.name || \'Lantai 1\'}</strong>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <span>Metode:</span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-slate-700\\\">Multi-Pilih Katalog / Kustom</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100\\\">\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            onClick={() => onOpenManualForm(selectedFloorId)}\\n            className=\\\"w-full py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl border border-blue-200 hover:border-blue-400 bg-white hover:bg-blue-50/60 text-blue-700 font-bold text-xs transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-2xs\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span>Buka Katalog &amp; Form Input</span>\\n            <ArrowRight className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create unified AutoQuantityTakeoffSection component replacing duplicate upload cards and side panels\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx\"}"
