    thinking: "**Revising App.tsx**\n\nOkay, I\'m currently focused on updating `App.tsx`. The goal is to replace the `ActionCards` component with `AutoQuantityTakeoffSection`. This shift addresses the duplicate UI elements that were presented. Previously, `ActionCards` rendered both the large \"Unggah Gambar / PDF\" card and a separate \"Input Manual\" card, and this has now been refactored.\n\n\n**Integrating New Component**\n\nI\'ve successfully integrated `AutoQuantityTakeoffSection` in `App.tsx`, replacing the redundant UI elements. This new section unifies the Asisten AI \342\200\223 Auto Quantity Takeoff functionalities: file upload, unit/scale settings, progress, summaries, and a \"Lihat Pekerjaan Hasil AI di Kalkulator\" button. Alongside this, I have the proportional \"Input Manual\" card. I am now working on cleaning up any other duplicate upload points within the application.\n\n\n"
