    thinking: "**Analyzing Firebase Integration**\n\nI\'m currently focused on evaluating the `firebase-integration-rpc` skill. The user\'s request for a robust backend authentication system (sign-in and account creation) using Firebase is key, and I\'m parsing this requirement for relevant components within the integration skill. My analysis is ongoing.\n\n\n"
