  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Firestore Schema Design**\n\nI\'m starting by examining `firebase-blueprint.json` and `firestore.rules`. I\'ll deploy rules to Firebase if needed, as outlined in `firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`. Right now, I\'m focusing on designing the Firestore schema within `firebase-blueprint.json`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
