  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining The Prompt**\n\nI\'ve successfully deployed the rules! My current focus is crafting the Master Prompt, aiming for a seamless and exceptional result. I\'m starting by updating the types. Adding the `UserAccountType` with \'Student\' and \'Estimator\' options feels like a good step. I think this will really start shaping the prompts and response behavior!\n\n\n**Expanding Data Types**\n\nI\'ve been expanding the data types to better represent the drawing information. I\'ve added `EngineeringDrawingType` to cover various architectural and structural drawings. I also added `AIDetectedRegion` and `AIBeamSloofSegment` to handle multi-region classification and segment-by-segment length calculations for Balok and Sloof components.\n\n\n**Standardizing Catalogs**\n\nI\'m now integrating the `AIBeamSloofSegment` type to standardize how we represent and manage beam and sloof data. I\'m updating `AIExtractionItem` and `ProjectWorkItem` to include these segment details, alongside `drawingType`, `pageNumber`, and `elementCode` for better organization. I\'m focusing on ensuring consistency across the catalog.\n\n\n**Cataloging Standard Items**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `uscCatalog.ts` file. My priority is standardizing the construction item catalog. I\'m removing any hardcoded dimensions or USC-specific labels to ensure broad applicability. I\'m also setting structural dimension defaults to `null` to prevent unintended default values. I\'m now integrating the requested structural items into `CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS`, including various \"Kolom\" types like `str-kolom-k1-beton`, `str-kolom-k2-beton`, `str-kolom-k3-beton`, `str-kolom-praktis`, and `str-kolom-kustom`, each with clearly defined parameters for calculations.\n\n\n**Adding More Concrete Items**\n\nI\'m now integrating more structural concrete items into the catalog. I\'ve focused on adding detailed definitions for \"Kolom Kustom\" and various \"Balok\" types, including `B1`, `B2`, `B3`, \"Balok Induk\", \"Balok Anak\", and \"Balok Bordes\". I\'m making sure to define their parameters, such as `lebar`, `tinggi`, and `panjang_total`, to keep things standardized.\n\n\n**Defining More Concrete Items**\n\nI\'m now cataloging more structural concrete items. I am defining `str-ring-balok`, `str-balok-kustom`, and various Sloof types, like `str-sloof-s1`, `str-sloof-s2`, `str-sloof-s3`, and `str-sloof-kustom`, along with `str-sloof-tulangan`. I\'m assigning parameters such as `panjang_total`, `lebar`, and `tinggi` to ensure standardized representation.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_340146"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * RuangRAB - Type Definitions\\n * Platform AI Quantity Takeoff & Kalkulator Volume Konstruksi\\n */\\n\\nexport type WorkCategory = \'Persiapan Dll\' | \'Struktural\' | \'Arsitektural\' | \'MEP\';\\n\\nexport type UserAccountType = \'Student\' | \'Estimator\' | \'Other\';\\n\\nexport interface UserProfile {\\n  uid: string;\\n  fullName: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  userType: UserAccountType;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  authProvider?: \'email\' | \'google\';\\n}\\n\\nexport type CalculationStatus =\\n  | \'Lengkap\'\\n  | \'Belum Lengkap\'\\n  | \'Perlu Input\'\\n  | \'Draf AI \342\200\224 Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n  | \'Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n  | \'Rumus Perlu Dikonfigurasi\'\\n  | \'Rumus Belum Dipetakan\'\\n  | \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\'\\n  | \'Tidak Digunakan\';\\n\\nexport type ParameterType = \'number\' | \'text\' | \'select\';\\n\\nexport type DrawingUnit = \'mm\' | \'cm\' | \'m\';\\n\\nexport type DrawingScale =\\n  | \'1:20\'\\n  | \'1:50\'\\n  | \'1:75\'\\n  | \'1:100\'\\n  | \'1:150\'\\n  | \'1:200\'\\n  | \'custom\'\\n  | \'unknown\';\\n\\nexport type EngineeringDrawingType =\\n  | \'Denah Arsitektur\'\\n  | \'Denah Kolom\'\\n  | \'Denah Balok\'\\n  | \'Denah Sloof\'\\n  | \'Denah Pondasi\'\\n  | \'Potongan Bangunan\'\\n  | \'Tampak Bangunan\'\\n  | \'Detail Tangga\'\\n  | \'Detail Pondasi\'\\n  | \'Detail Sambungan\'\\n  | \'Detail Penulangan\'\\n  | \'Tabel Dimensi dan Penulangan\'\\n  | \'Detail Konstruksi Lainnya\';\\n\\nexport interface AIDetectedRegion {\\n  pageNumber: number;\\n  drawingType: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n  title: string;\\n  scale?: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIBeamSloofSegment {\\n  id: string;\\n  elementCode: string; // Contoh: \\\"S.1\\\", \\\"S1\\\", \\\"B1\\\", \\\"B2\\\"\\n  elementCategory: \'sloof\' | \'balok\';\\n  segmentName: string; // Contoh: \\\"Segmen Horizontal Grid 1 (As A\342\200\223B)\\\"\\n  gridLocation: string; // Contoh: \\\"As A\342\200\223B / Grid 1\\\"\\n  rawLength: number; // Nilai tertulis pada gambar (misal 600 cm atau 6.00 m)\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit;\\n  lengthMeters: number; // Panjang 1 segmen dalam meter (m)\\n  count: number; // Jumlah segmen identik pada jalur tersebut\\n  subtotalMeters: number; // lengthMeters * count\\n  pageNumber?: number;\\n  drawingType?: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParameterConflict {\\n  newValue: number;\\n  rawExtractedValue: number;\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit;\\n  sourceDocument: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParameterItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  placeholder?: string;\\n  value: number | string | null;\\n  unit: string;\\n  type?: ParameterType;\\n  required?: boolean;\\n  source?: \'manual\' | \'ai\' | \'derived\' | \'reference\';\\n  sourceDocument?: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n  drawingType?: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n  pageNumber?: number;\\n  rawExtractedValue?: number;\\n  rawUnit?: DrawingUnit;\\n  isVerified?: boolean;\\n  conflict?: ParameterConflict | null;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  excelCellRef?: string; // Metadata internal\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WorkComponent {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  parameters: Record<string, number | null>;\\n  formulaText?: string;\\n  computedVolume?: number | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CatalogWorkItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  code?: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  category: WorkCategory;\\n  subCategory?: string;\\n  floorRule: \'umum\' | \'per_lantai\' | \'atap_saja\' | \'fondasi_saja\';\\n  description: string;\\n  defaultUnit: string;\\n  formulaDisplay: string;\\n  customFormula?: string;\\n  isCustomCatalog?: boolean;\\n  excelSheet: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelCell: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelFormula?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  parameters: ParameterItem[];\\n  defaultComponents?: WorkComponent[];\\n  calculationMethod: (params: Record<string, number>, components?: WorkComponent[]) => number | null;\\n  verificationStatus: CalculationStatus;\\n  verificationNotes?: string;\\n  hasExternalRef?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProjectWorkItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  catalogId?: string;\\n  dedupKey?: string; // Kunci stabil pencegahan duplikasi (floorId + catalogId + elementCode)\\n  name: string;\\n  category: WorkCategory;\\n  subCategory?: string;\\n  floorId: string; // \\\"fl-umum\\\" atau floorId\\n  elementLocation?: string; // Lokasi / As / Ruang dari gambar\\n  elementCode?: string; // Kode elemen struktur (misal: S.1, B1, K1)\\n  segments?: AIBeamSloofSegment[]; // Rincian segmen jika pekerjaan berupa Balok / Sloof\\n  unit: string;\\n  formulaDisplay: string;\\n  parameters: ParameterItem[];\\n  components: WorkComponent[];\\n  calculatedVolume: number | null;\\n  status: CalculationStatus;\\n  statusMessage?: string;\\n  origin?: \'manual\' | \'ai\';\\n  aiVerificationStatus?: \'draft\' | \'verified\' | \'rejected\';\\n  sourceDocument?: string;\\n  identificationReason?: string;\\n  excelSheet?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelCell?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelFormula?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  customFormula?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  isActive: boolean;\\n  lastUpdated?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FloorItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string; // e.g. \\\"Lantai 1\\\", \\\"Lantai 2\\\", \\\"Umum & Pondasi\\\"\\n  level: number;\\n  elevation?: string;\\n  description?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProjectData {\\n  id: string;\\n  ownerUid?: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  location?: string;\\n  description?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  floorCount: number;\\n  floors: FloorItem[];\\n  works: ProjectWorkItem[];\\n  rejectedDraftKeys?: string[];\\n  catalogVersion: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIExtractionItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  targetCategory: string;\\n  suggestedWorkName: string;\\n  elementCode?: string; // Kode elemen pada gambar (S.1, B1, K1, P1, dll)\\n  drawingType?: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n  pageNumber?: number;\\n  catalogId?: string;\\n  parameterId?: string;\\n  parameterName: string;\\n  rawExtractedValue: number;\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit;\\n  explicitUnitOnDrawing?: string;\\n  convertedValue: number;\\n  convertedUnit: string;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  sourceDocument: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  userCorrection?: number;\\n  status: \'pending\' | \'approved\' | \'rejected\' | \'applied\';\\n  targetWorkId?: string;\\n  targetParamId?: string;\\n  isRecommendationOnly?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIAutoTakeoffSummary {\\n  documentSummary: string;\\n  drawingType: \'arsitektur_denah\' | \'struktur_denah\' | \'potongan_detail\' | \'lainnya\';\\n  detectedRegions?: AIDetectedRegion[];\\n  segments?: AIBeamSloofSegment[];\\n  identifiedFloor: string;\\n  identifiedScale: string;\\n  extractedCount: number;\\n  createdDraftWorksCount: number;\\n  updatedExistingWorksCount: number;\\n  incompleteWorksCount: number;\\n  conflictCount: number;\\n  recommendations: {\\n    catalogId: string;\\n    name: string;\\n    category: WorkCategory;\\n    reason: string;\\n  }[];\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Update src/types/index.ts with UserProfile, EngineeringDrawingType, AIDetectedRegion, and AIBeamSloofSegment types\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating TypeScript definitions in src/types/index.ts\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update src/types/index.ts\"}"
