  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 3
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Transform **RuangRAB** (AI Quantity Takeoff & Kalkulator Volume Konstruksi) from a single-user USC demo into a multi-user, public-ready AI Quantity Takeoff platform.\n   - **Deliverables**:\n     1. **User Authentication & Account Isolation (Sign In & Create Account)**:\n        - Landing/Auth page (`src/components/AuthPage.tsx`) before accessing the dashboard with **Sign In** and **Create Account / Sign Up** tabs + Google Sign-In (`signInWithPopup`) + Forgot Password flow.\n        - Sign Up fields: Full Name (`fullName`), Email (`email`), Password (`password`), Confirm Password (`confirmPassword`), User Type (`Student`, `Estimator`, `Other`).\n        - Remove hardcoded \"Adjie / Estimator\" from `Header.tsx`. Display the logged-in user\'s name, email, role (`Student` / `Estimator` / `Other`), initials avatar, account settings modal (`src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx`), and logout button.\n        - Isolate projects per user (`src/services/projectStorage.ts` + Cloud Firestore `/users/{uid}/projects/{projectId}`).\n     2. **Default Project Without USC Demo Data**:\n        - New users start with a clean project (`Proyek Baru`) with standard floor groups (`Umum & Pondasi`, `Lantai 1`, `Lantai 2`) and empty work lists (zero USC demo dimensions).\n        - Preserve any existing custom projects in `localStorage`.\n        - Display a **User Overview / Projects Hub** banner (`src/components/UserOverviewBanner.tsx`) showing welcome message, project count, active project, last activity, quick project switcher, and \"Buat / Kelola Proyek\" button.\n     3. **Standardized Construction Catalog (`src/data/uscCatalog.ts`)**:\n        - Generalize catalog items with `value: null` defaults and no USC dimensions:\n          - Columns: `Kolom K1`, `Kolom K2`, `Kolom K3`, `Kolom Praktis`, `Kolom Kustom`.\n          - Beams: `Balok B1`, `Balok B2`, `Balok B3`, `Balok Induk`, `Balok Anak`, `Balok Bordes`, `Ring Balok`, `Balok Kustom`.\n          - Sloof: `Sloof S1`, `Sloof S2`, `Sloof S3`, `Sloof Kustom`, `Sloof - Pembesian Tulangan Pokok`, `Sloof - Bekisting Samping`.\n          - Foundations, Slabs, Stairs, Roof, Architectural, and MEP items.\n     4. **Intuitive Vertical Parameter Input Form (`src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx`)**:\n        - Vertical stacked layout where each parameter label is directly above its input box, with explicit unit badges, informative placeholders, required (`*`) indicators, empty-field warnings, positive number validation (never treating empty as `0`), formula display, live automatic volume preview, and a **Tabel Rincian Segmen Balok / Sloof**.\n     5. **Multi-Type Engineering Drawing AI Reader & Segment-Based Beam/Sloof Length Summation**:\n        - Classify each page/region into the 13 drawing types (`Denah Arsitektur`, `Denah Kolom`, `Denah Balok`, `Denah Sloof`, `Denah Pondasi`, `Potongan Bangunan`, `Tampak Bangunan`, `Detail Tangga`, `Detail Pondasi`, `Detail Sambungan`, `Detail Penulangan`, `Tabel Dimensi dan Penulangan`, `Detail Konstruksi Lainnya`).\n        - Extract and sum individual beam/sloof segments per grid line (`AIBeamSloofSegment[]`) rather than using building perimeter.\n        - Cross-link element codes (`S.1`, `B1`, `K1`) between plans and dimension/reinforcement tables.\n     6. **Final Report**:\n        - Report modified files, implemented features, tested features, test results with `/public/assets/aistudio/Gedung_USC_A4-16_202766c9.pdf`, any remaining issues, and any external Firebase Console configuration note.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed & Verified**:\n     - Provisioned Firebase (`crucial-azimuth-1fx4d`, database `ai-studio-ruangrabaiquanti-fe31a1d6-62db-405b-8277-2f5da668fc00`) via `fax.ProvisionFirebase`.\n     - Installed `firebase` package via `install_applet_package`.\n     - Created `firebase-blueprint.json`, `security_spec.md`, `firestore.rules`, and deployed security rules via `fax.DeployRules`.\n     - Created `src/firebase.ts` with Firebase Auth, Firestore initialization, `testConnection()`, and `handleFirestoreError`.\n     - Updated `src/types/index.ts` with `UserProfile`, `UserAccountType`, `EngineeringDrawingType`, `AIDetectedRegion`, and `AIBeamSloofSegment`.\n     - Updated `src/data/uscCatalog.ts` with standardized construction items (`Kolom K1/K2/K3/Praktis/Kustom`, `Balok B1/B2/B3/Induk/Anak/Bordes/Ring/Kustom`, `Sloof S1/S2/S3/Kustom`, etc.) with `value: null` defaults.\n     - Created `src/services/authService.ts`, `src/components/AuthPage.tsx`, `src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx`, and `src/components/UserOverviewBanner.tsx`.\n     - Updated `src/components/Header.tsx` (removed hardcoded \"Adjie\", added dynamic user name, role badge, initials avatar, profile modal button, and logout button).\n     - Updated `src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx` (vertical parameter input cards, live volume preview, positive number validation, and segment breakdown table).\n     - Updated `src/services/projectStorage.ts` (per-user project isolation, clean `\"Proyek Baru\"` default project without USC demo data, Firestore sync, and segment-based beam/sloof takeoff mapping).\n     - Updated `src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`, `src/components/ProjectManagementModal.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, and `server.ts`.\n     - Ran `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` \342\200\224 **both passed with 0 errors**.\n     - Tested `/api/auth/register` via `node -e` \342\200\224 **succeeded (`AUTH REGISTER TEST: true Estimator`)**.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - In `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`, the valid free-tier flash aliases are `\'gemini-3.8-flash\'`, `\'gemini-3.1-flash-lite\'`, and `\'gemini-flash-latest\'`.\n   - When we ran the test script against `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` with `Gedung_USC_A4-16_202766c9.pdf`, `gemini-3.8-flash` and `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` experienced a temporary 503 spike (`This model is currently experiencing high demand`). Adding `\'gemini-flash-latest\'` to `plannedAttempts` in `server.ts` provides a third distinct model pool so PDF analysis succeeds even when `gemini-3.8-flash` and `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` have a 503 spike.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **TypeScript Lint Error in `WorkDetailModal.tsx`**: `Property \'statusMessage\' does not exist on type \'{ volume: number | null; status: CalculationStatus; message?: string | undefined; }\'`. Fixed by replacing `liveCalcResult.statusMessage` with `liveCalcResult.message`. Verified with `lint_applet` (exit code 0).\n   - **Upstream 503 High Demand on `gemini-3.8-flash` / `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`**: Add `\'gemini-flash-latest\'` to `plannedAttempts` in `server.ts` so it falls back across all three valid Flash model aliases (`gemini-3.8-flash` -> `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` -> `gemini-flash-latest`).\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - All frontend and backend files are written, compiled, and linted cleanly.\n   - Dev server is running on port 3000.\n\n6. **Next Steps (Immediate & Final)**\n   1. Update `plannedAttempts` in `server.ts` to include `\'gemini-flash-latest\'` (`gemini-3.8-flash` -> `gemini-3.1-flash-lite` -> `gemini-flash-latest`).\n   2. Restart the dev server (`restart_dev_server`), run a quick test against `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` with `public/assets/aistudio/Gedung_USC_A4-16_202766c9.pdf`, and run `compile_applet` + `lint_applet`.\n   3. Present the comprehensive final report in Bahasa Indonesia covering:\n      1. Daftar file yang dimodifikasi\n      2. Daftar fitur yang berhasil diimplementasikan\n      3. Daftar fitur yang telah diuji\n      4. Hasil pengujian dengan dokumen gambar/PDF (`Gedung USC A4-16.pdf`)\n      5. Masalah yang masih tersisa (jika ada) & konfigurasi eksternal opsional di Firebase Console.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Never expose USC demo data as default values for new projects or catalog items.\n   - Never expose Excel filenames, sheet names, cell coordinates, or raw Excel formulas in the UI.\n</summary>"
