  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Addressing Timeout Issues**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the `UND_ERR_HEADERS_TIMEOUT` error to a stalled `gemini-flash-latest` call, which took a full 5 minutes to produce headers. To mitigate this, I\'m integrating a per-attempt timeout into each Gemini API call within `server.ts`. The initial timeout value will be 45 seconds to ensure a sluggish model instance does not indefinitely delay the user\'s request.\n\n\n"
