  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing PDF Bottleneck**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed a key bottleneck: the extensive nesting within the `responseSchema` in `server.ts`. Those deeply nested arrays, particularly `detectedRegions`, `segments`, and `items` with their 11 fields, are causing Gemini\'s structured output parser to generate an enormous grammar for PDFs, significantly slowing down processing. I\'m now examining the impact of `responseMime`.\n\n\n"
