    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Execute **PEMBARUAN MASTER PROMPT \342\200\224 RUANGESTIMASI** on the existing AI Quantity Takeoff application while preserving all previous features (Authentication, Account Isolation, Standardized Catalog, Vertical Parameter Form, Multi-Type Engineering Drawing AI Reader, Segment-Based Beam/Sloof Length Summation, and Excel Export).\n   - **Key Deliverables**:\n     1. **Product Rebranding (`RuangRAB` -> `RuangEstimasi`)**:\n        - Rename the product across the entire application to **RuangEstimasi** with the official product description:\n          `\"RuangEstimasi \342\200\224 Platform AI Quantity Takeoff untuk membantu membaca gambar teknik, menghitung volume pekerjaan konstruksi, dan mengelola estimasi kuantitas proyek.\"`\n        - Apply to: Login/Sign Up page (`src/components/AuthPage.tsx`), Dashboard Logo & Sidebar (`src/components/Sidebar.tsx`), Header (`src/components/Header.tsx`), Page Title & Meta (`index.html`, `metadata.json`), User Profile Modal (`src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx`), AI Assistant (`src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`, `src/components/AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx`), Excel Export (`src/services/excelExport.ts`), Auth Service (`src/services/authService.ts`), and `src/App.tsx`.\n        - Ensure no `RuangRAB` text remains visible in the UI.\n     2. **Default Standard Works Per Project & Floor (Zero Default Dimensions)**:\n        - When creating a new project (`createNewProject`), automatically populate standard construction work templates grouped by floor (`1. Umum & Pondasi`, `2. Lantai 1`, `3. Lantai 2 dan seterusnya`).\n        - All default works must be pure templates with empty parameters (`value: null` / `Kosong`) and `calculatedVolume: null` (`\342\200\224`). Never carry dimensions, counts, or volumes from the USC demo project.\n        - Empty values must be treated as unfilled (`Belum Diisi`), never as `0`.\n     3. **Full User Control Over Default & Project Works**:\n        - Single work deletion with confirmation.\n        - **Multi-select work deletion**: Select multiple works via checkboxes in `src/components/WorkTable.tsx` and delete them at once with confirmation.\n        - **Restore deleted works**: Ability to undo/restore recently deleted works OR re-add them from the catalog OR reload missing standard works per floor.\n        - **Edit work name & parameters**: Allow editing the work name as well as parameters inside `src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx`.\n        - Deleting or editing a work in a project must never delete or modify the global catalog template or works in other projects.\n     4. **Floor Management (`src/components/FloorManagementModal.tsx` & `src/App.tsx`)**:\n        - Adding a new floor automatically populates standard construction work templates for that floor (`createDefaultWorksForFloor`).\n        - Deleting a floor must NOT immediately delete works without confirmation: provide a confirmation dialog in `FloorManagementModal.tsx` giving the user the choice to **move works on that floor to another floor** OR **delete the floor along with its works**.\n     5. **AI Quantity Takeoff Deduplication with Default Works**:\n        - When AI reads a drawing and identifies a work item that already exists in the default work list for that floor (e.g., `Sloof S1`, `Balok B1`, `Kolom K1`, `Pembersihan Lahan`, `Dinding Bata Ringan`), AI must update/propose filling parameters on that existing work item rather than creating a duplicate work item.\n        - AI must never automatically delete default works simply because they were not found in a drawing.\n     6. **User Experience (UX) & Work Statuses**:\n        - Show explanatory banner in `WorkTable.tsx`:\n          `\"Daftar pekerjaan standar telah disiapkan untuk membantu proses estimasi. Silakan hapus pekerjaan yang tidak diperlukan dan lengkapi parameter sesuai gambar proyek Anda.\"`\n        - Display clear work statuses:\n          - `Belum Diisi` (all required parameters are empty/`null`)\n          - `Tidak Lengkap` (some parameters are filled, but required parameters are still missing)\n          - `Perlu Verifikasi` (AI-filled parameters or dimension conflicts awaiting user approval)\n          - `Terverifikasi` (all required parameters are filled and verified)\n        - Works without complete parameters must never produce a final volume (`calculatedVolume = null`).\n     7. **Comprehensive Verification (14-Point Test Suite)**:\n        - Run real verification tests for all 14 items listed in Section 7 of the prompt.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed**:\n     - Read `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md` and `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`.\n     - Verified `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` with `public/assets/aistudio/Gedung_USC_A4-16_202766c9.pdf` (returned HTTP 200 OK with `Denah Sloof` + `Tabel Dimensi dan Penulangan`, 2 grid segment groups totaling `360 m`, and `Sloof S1` with `panjang_total: 360 m`, `lebar: 40 cm`, `tinggi: 60 cm`).\n     - Updated `/index.html` and `/metadata.json` with **RuangEstimasi** title and official product description.\n     - Updated `/src/types/index.ts` to add `\'Belum Diisi\'`, `\'Tidak Lengkap\'`, `\'Perlu Verifikasi\'`, and `\'Terverifikasi\'` to `CalculationStatus`.\n     - Updated `/src/services/calculationEngine.ts` to compute `\'Belum Diisi\'`, `\'Tidak Lengkap\'`, `\'Perlu Verifikasi\'`, and `\'Terverifikasi\'` statuses, format `null` volumes as `\'\342\200\224\'`, and ensure incomplete works never enter final verified volume totals.\n     - Updated `/src/services/projectStorage.ts`:\n       - Added `DEFAULT_UMUM_PONDASI_CATALOG_IDS`, `DEFAULT_LANTAI_1_CATALOG_IDS`, `DEFAULT_LANTAI_ATAS_CATALOG_IDS`, and exported `createDefaultWorksForFloor(floorId, floorLevel)`.\n       - Updated `createNewProject` and `loadAllProjects` to automatically populate the standard default works per floor with all parameters `null` and `calculatedVolume: null`.\n       - Updated `applyAutoQuantityTakeoff` so AI updates existing default works on the target floor (or `fl-umum` for foundation/general works) without creating duplicate works.\n   - **Remaining to Edit**:\n     - Branding updates (`RuangRAB` -> `RuangEstimasi`) in `src/components/AuthPage.tsx`, `src/components/Sidebar.tsx`, `src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx`, `src/services/excelExport.ts`, `src/services/authService.ts`, `src/data/uscCatalog.ts`, `src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`, `src/components/AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx`, `server.ts`.\n     - Feature + branding updates in `src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx` (editable work name + vertical parameters), `src/components/WorkTable.tsx` (standard works banner, `Belum Diisi` / `Tidak Lengkap` / `Perlu Verifikasi` / `Terverifikasi` badges & filters, multi-select checkboxes & batch delete with confirmation, undo/restore deleted works), `src/components/FloorManagementModal.tsx` (option to move works to another floor or delete works when deleting a floor), and `src/App.tsx` (wire up batch delete, undo/restore deleted works, floor addition with `createDefaultWorksForFloor`, floor deletion with move/delete option, and `RuangEstimasi` branding).\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - In `server.ts`, using `responseMimeType: \'application/json\'` with explicit JSON structure in the prompt and a 35-second per-attempt timeout (`Promise.race`) across `gemini-3.8-flash`, `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, and `gemini-4-argon` prevents grammar-compilation hangs on complex PDFs and returns accurate multi-region and segment extractions in ~15 seconds.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **Previous `UND_ERR_HEADERS_TIMEOUT` on complex PDF schema**: Caused by a 170-line nested `responseSchema` stalling constrained decoding on PDF input. Fixed in `server.ts` by specifying the JSON schema in `userPrompt` with `responseMimeType: \'application/json\'` and adding a 35s timeout per attempt. Verified with `Gedung_USC_A4-16_202766c9.pdf` (HTTP 200 OK).\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - `index.html`, `metadata.json`, `src/types/index.ts`, `src/services/calculationEngine.ts`, and `src/services/projectStorage.ts` are already updated for **RuangEstimasi** and default standard floor works.\n\n6. **Next Steps (Immediate Execution Plan)**\n   1. **Update Branding (`RuangRAB` -> `RuangEstimasi`) in UI & Services**:\n      - `src/components/AuthPage.tsx`: Change all `RuangRAB` text to `RuangEstimasi` and display the official product description: `\"RuangEstimasi \342\200\224 Platform AI Quantity Takeoff untuk membantu membaca gambar teknik, menghitung volume pekerjaan konstruksi, dan mengelola estimasi kuantitas proyek.\"`\n      - `src/components/Sidebar.tsx`: Change `\"RuangRAB Konstruksi\"` to `\"RuangEstimasi\"` in both desktop and mobile drawer headers.\n      - `src/components/Header.tsx`: Display `RuangEstimasi` subtitle/description cleanly.\n      - `src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx`: Show `RuangEstimasi` product identity in the profile modal.\n      - `src/services/excelExport.ts`: Change `RuangRAB` to `RuangEstimasi` in workbook creator, sheet 1 title (`RUANGESTIMASI \342\200\224 RINGKASAN DATA PROYEK & QUANTITY TAKEOFF`), and downloaded file name (`RuangEstimasi_${sanitizedProjName}_${dateStr}.xlsx`).\n      - `src/services/authService.ts`, `src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`, `src/components/AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx`, `src/data/uscCatalog.ts`, `server.ts`: Replace any remaining `RuangRAB` occurrences with `RuangEstimasi`.\n   2. **Update `src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx`**:\n      - Add an input field to edit `work.name` (`Nama Pekerjaan`) alongside editing parameters so the user can rename any project work item without affecting the global catalog.\n   3. **Update `src/components/FloorManagementModal.tsx`**:\n      - When deleting a floor, show a confirmation dialog with two choices when the floor has works:\n        1. Move all works on that floor to another selected floor (`moveTargetFloorId`) and delete the floor.\n        2. Delete the floor and all works on it.\n   4. **Update `src/components/WorkTable.tsx`**:\n      - Add the standard works guidance banner:\n        `\"Daftar pekerjaan standar telah disiapkan untuk membantu proses estimasi. Silakan hapus pekerjaan yang tidak diperlukan dan lengkapi parameter sesuai gambar proyek Anda.\"`\n      - Update status badges and status filter tabs for `Belum Diisi`, `Tidak Lengkap`, `Perlu Verifikasi`, and `Terverifikasi`.\n      - Display `Kosong` clearly in the parameter column when all parameters of a work are `null`, and `\342\200\224` in the volume column.\n      - Add multi-select checkboxes per work row and per floor group header, with a bulk delete button (`Hapus Pekerjaan Terpilih`) and confirmation modal.\n      - Add an \"Urungkan Hapus\" (Restore deleted works) button and a \"Muat Ulang Pekerjaan Standar\" option.\n   5. **Update `src/App.tsx`**:\n      - Replace `RuangRAB` with `RuangEstimasi` in toast and loading messages.\n      - In `handleAddFloor`: automatically call `createDefaultWorksForFloor(newFloor.id, newFloor.level)` and add the standard works to the project.\n      - In `handleDeleteFloor(floorId, moveWorksToFloorId?)`: support moving works to `moveWorksToFloorId` or deleting them.\n      - Add `handleDeleteMultipleWorks(workIds: string[])`, `recentlyDeletedWorks` state + `handleRestoreDeletedWorks()`, and `handleRestoreStandardFloorWorks(floorId)`.\n   6. **Compile, Lint, & Run All 14 Verification Tests**:\n      - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet`.\n      - Run automated verification script testing all 14 points in Section 7 of the prompt (account creation, new project default works with empty parameters/volumes, multi-delete, re-adding from catalog, adding new floor with standard works, project isolation between Project A and Project B, AI updating existing default works without duplication, incomplete works excluded from final volume, and zero `RuangRAB` strings remaining in UI).\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Official product name: **RuangEstimasi** (no visible `RuangRAB` text anywhere in the UI).\n   - Default project and newly added floors must have standard work items pre-populated with empty parameters (`value: null`) and no volume (`calculatedVolume: null`).\n   - Do not claim any test succeeded without running it first.\n</summary>"
