    combined_output {
      full: "PASS: index.html contains RuangEstimasiPASS: index.html does not contain RuangRABPASS: AuthPage.tsx contains RuangEstimasiPASS: AuthPage.tsx does not contain RuangRABPASS: Sidebar.tsx contains RuangEstimasiPASS: Sidebar.tsx does not contain RuangRABPASS: Proyek A has 3 floor groups (Umum & Pondasi, Lantai 1, Lantai 2)PASS: Proyek A automatically populated with 38 standard worksFAIL: Umum & Pondasi has 9 default works"
