  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 5
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Execute **PEMBARUAN MASTER PROMPT \342\200\224 RUANGESTIMASI** on the existing AI Quantity Takeoff web application while preserving all previously built features (User Authentication, Account & Project Isolation, Standardized Catalog, Vertical Parameter Form, Multi-Type Engineering Drawing AI Reader, Segment-Based Beam/Sloof Length Summation, and Excel Export).\n   - **Key Deliverables**:\n     1. **Product Rebranding (`RuangRAB` -> `RuangEstimasi`)**:\n        - Rename the product across the entire application to **RuangEstimasi** with the official product description:\n          `\"RuangEstimasi \342\200\224 Platform AI Quantity Takeoff untuk membantu membaca gambar teknik, menghitung volume pekerjaan konstruksi, dan mengelola estimasi kuantitas proyek.\"`\n        - Applied across `index.html`, `metadata.json`, `src/components/AuthPage.tsx`, `src/components/Sidebar.tsx`, `src/components/Header.tsx`, `src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx`, `src/components/AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx`, `src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`, `src/components/UserOverviewBanner.tsx`, `src/services/excelExport.ts`, `src/services/authService.ts`, `src/data/uscCatalog.ts`, `src/App.tsx`, and `server.ts`.\n     2. **Default Standard Works Per Project & Floor (Zero Default Dimensions)**:\n        - Creating a new project (`createNewProject`) automatically populates 60 standard construction work templates grouped by floor (`Umum & Pondasi`: 18 works, `Lantai 1`: 21 works, `Lantai 2 dan seterusnya`: 21 works per floor).\n        - All default works are pure templates with empty parameters (`value: null` / `Kosong`), `calculatedVolume: null` (`\342\200\224`), and status `Belum Diisi`. Zero dimensions or volumes from the USC demo project are carried over.\n     3. **Full User Control Over Default & Project Works**:\n        - Single work deletion with confirmation.\n        - Multi-select work deletion via checkboxes in `src/components/WorkTable.tsx` with confirmation.\n        - Undo/restore recently deleted works (`Pulihkan Pekerjaan Terhapus`) and reload missing standard works per floor (`Muat Pekerjaan Standar`).\n        - Editable work name (`Nama Pekerjaan`) alongside vertical parameter inputs in `src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx`.\n        - Project & Catalog isolation: deleting or editing a work in Project A never modifies or deletes the global catalog template or works in Project B.\n     4. **Floor Management (`src/components/FloorManagementModal.tsx` & `src/App.tsx`)**:\n        - Adding a new floor automatically populates standard construction work templates for that floor (`createDefaultWorksForFloor`).\n        - Deleting a floor presents a confirmation dialog in `FloorManagementModal.tsx` allowing the user to either **move works on that floor to another floor** OR **delete the floor along with its works**.\n     5. **AI Quantity Takeoff Deduplication with Default Works**:\n        - When AI reads a drawing and identifies a work item that already exists in the default work list for that floor (e.g., `Sloof S1`, `Balok B1`, `Kolom K1`), `applyAutoQuantityTakeoff` updates the existing default work item\'s parameters and sets its status to `Perlu Verifikasi` instead of creating a duplicate work item.\n     6. **User Experience (UX) & Work Statuses**:\n        - Explanatory banner in `WorkTable.tsx`:\n          `\"Daftar pekerjaan standar telah disiapkan untuk membantu proses estimasi. Silakan hapus pekerjaan yang tidak diperlukan dan lengkapi parameter sesuai gambar proyek Anda.\"`\n        - Four clear work statuses and status filter tabs: `Belum Diisi`, `Tidak Lengkap`, `Perlu Verifikasi`, and `Terverifikasi`.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed**:\n     - All code edits across `index.html`, `metadata.json`, `src/types/index.ts`, `src/services/calculationEngine.ts`, `src/services/projectStorage.ts`, `src/services/authService.ts`, `src/services/excelExport.ts`, `src/data/uscCatalog.ts`, `src/components/AuthPage.tsx`, `src/components/Sidebar.tsx`, `src/components/Header.tsx`, `src/components/UserProfileModal.tsx`, `src/components/AutoQuantityTakeoffSection.tsx`, `src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`, `src/components/UserOverviewBanner.tsx`, `src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx`, `src/components/FloorManagementModal.tsx`, `src/components/WorkTable.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, and `server.ts`.\n     - Ran `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` \342\200\224 both succeeded with 0 errors.\n     - Restarted dev server (`restart_dev_server`).\n     - Ran the verification test suite (`npx tsx -e ...`):\n       - Passed Checks 1\342\200\2238 (`RuangEstimasi` branding, 60 default works per new 2-story project, all parameters `null`, all volumes `null`, `Belum Diisi` status, 0 final volume for incomplete works, multi-delete isolation between Project A and Project B, re-adding from catalog, and adding `Lantai 3` with 22 standard works).\n       - In Check 9 (AI updating `Sloof S1` with `360 * 0.4 * 0.6`), `updatedSloof.calculatedVolume` returned `86.39999999999999` due to IEEE 754 floating-point multiplication before rounding.\n   - **In Progress**:\n     - Rounding `calculatedVolume` in `calculateWorkItemVolume` (`src/services/calculationEngine.ts`, lines 230\342\200\223320) to 4 decimal places (`Number(vol.toFixed(4))`) so `360 * 0.4 * 0.6` yields exact `86.4`, then re-running the verification script and `compile_applet`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - `DEFAULT_UMUM_PONDASI_CATALOG_IDS`, `DEFAULT_LANTAI_1_CATALOG_IDS`, and `DEFAULT_LANTAI_ATAS_CATALOG_IDS` in `src/services/projectStorage.ts` are now aligned with exact catalog IDs in `src/data/uscCatalog.ts`.\n   - In `src/services/calculationEngine.ts`, `calculateWorkItemVolume` returns raw floating-point multiplication results (`360 * 0.4 * 0.6 = 86.39999999999999`); rounding non-null volume results with `Number(volume.toFixed(4))` eliminates IEEE 754 floating-point precision noise.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **Mismatch in 6 catalog IDs in `DEFAULT_LANTAI_1_CATALOG_IDS` / `DEFAULT_UMUM_PONDASI_CATALOG_IDS`**: Fixed in `src/services/projectStorage.ts` to match `src/data/uscCatalog.ts` (`str-pelat-lantai-beton`, `ars-plafond-gypsum`, `ars-pintu-p1-lengkap`, `ars-jendela-j1-lengkap`, `mep-titik-lampu`, `mep-sanitasi-kran-air`, `mep-pipa-pvc-air-bersih`).\n   - **IEEE 754 floating-point precision in `calculateWorkItemVolume` (`86.39999999999999` vs `86.4`)**: Will be fixed in `src/services/calculationEngine.ts` by rounding `volume` to `Number(volume.toFixed(4))`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - We were viewing `src/services/calculationEngine.ts` to round `calculatedVolume` to `Number(volume.toFixed(4))`.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. View lines 220\342\200\223330 of `/src/services/calculationEngine.ts` and round non-null calculated volumes with `Number(volume.toFixed(4))`.\n   2. Run the verification test script via `run_command` to confirm all 9 assertions (covering all 14 verification points in Section 7 of the prompt) pass with exit code 0.\n   3. Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to confirm the final build is clean, then present a concise summary of the **RuangEstimasi** updates to the user.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Official product name is **RuangEstimasi** (no `RuangRAB` text visible to users).\n   - Default project works must have empty parameters (`null`) and no volume (`null`).\n</summary>"
