  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 7
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nThe user requested `# PERBAIKAN SUMBER TEMPLATE PEKERJAAN RUANGESTIMASI`:\n- **Core Request**: Fix the standard work template source in **RuangEstimasi** so that the **complete Gedung USC work catalog/reference** (`RAB Gedung USC.xlsx` / `/public/assets/aistudio/katalog_volume_usc_639e973f.json` & `/src/data/uscCatalog.ts`) is used as the global standard template source (`USC_STANDARD_TEMPLATE` / `CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS`), rather than a simplified subset or a simple Lantai 2 template.\n- **Success Criteria & Deliverables**:\n  1. **Restore USC Work Template (`## 1. PULIHKAN TEMPLATE PEKERJAAN USC`)**:\n     - Include the complete work structure from the USC reference across:\n       - Kelompok Umum & Pondasi (`fl-umum`, `level: 0`)\n       - Kelompok pekerjaan Lantai 1 (`fl-1`, `level: 1`)\n       - Kelompok pekerjaan Lantai 2 (`fl-2`, `level: 2`)\n       - Kelompok lantai lainnya (`fl-3`, `fl-4`, dst.)\n       - Pekerjaan Persiapan, Struktural, Arsitektural, dan MEP\n       - All work types and variations in the USC catalog (not just K1, K2, B1, B2).\n     - Preserve valid work names, categories, units, parameter definitions, and original formulas (`excelSheet`, `excelCell`, `excelFormula`, `formulaDisplay`, `calculationMethod`).\n  2. **Clear All USC Demonstration Values (`## 2. KOSONGKAN SELURUH NILAI DEMONSTRASI USC`)**:\n     - Clear all dimensions, lengths, widths, heights, thicknesses, element counts, areas, volumes, parameter values (`value: null`), calculation results (`calculatedVolume: null`), and old verification statuses.\n     - Initial status of all works in a new project must be `\"Belum Diisi\"`.\n  3. **Do Not Delete User Project Data (`## 3. JANGAN HAPUS DATA PROYEK PENGGUNA`)**:\n     - Preserve all user projects, custom works created by users, and valid project parameters.\n     - Never overwrite existing user project data with the USC template or delete works because they are not in the USC catalog.\n  4. **Separate Global Template & Project Data (`## 4. PISAHKAN TEMPLATE GLOBAL DAN DATA PROYEK`)**:\n     - **A. Global Standard Template (`USC_STANDARD_TEMPLATE`)**: Sourced from the full USC catalog, zero project dimensions, read-only/deep-cloned via `getGlobalUscTemplate()`.\n     - **B. User Project Data**: Independent copy per project (`Proyek A`, `Proyek B`), editable/deletable without affecting the global template or other projects, supporting custom works.\n  5. **New Projects Must Use Full USC Template (`## 5. PROYEK BARU HARUS MENGGUNAKAN TEMPLATE USC`)**:\n     - `createNewProject` copies the full USC work structure per floor with all parameters `null`, `calculatedVolume: null`, and status `\"Belum Diisi\"`.\n  6. **Data Migration & Recovery (`## 6. MIGRASI DAN PEMULIHAN DATA`)**:\n     - Non-destructively migrate existing user projects (`migrateProjectToFullUscTemplate`) so any project created with an older/reduced `catalogVersion` gets all missing USC template works restored per floor while preserving 100% of custom works and user-filled parameters.\n  7. **Testing (`## 7. PENGUJIAN`)**:\n     - Verify all 10 checklist items from section 7 of the prompt.\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Skills & Reference Files Read**:\n  - `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`\n  - `/public/assets/aistudio/panduan_integrasi_volume_usc_8fc32daf.md`\n  - `/public/assets/aistudio/katalog_volume_usc_639e973f.json` (the complete 3-sheet conversion of `RAB Gedung USC.xlsx`: `Volume Persiapan Dll`, `Volume Struktural`, `Volume Arsitektural`)\n  - `/src/data/uscCatalog.ts`, `/src/services/projectStorage.ts`, `/src/services/calculationEngine.ts`, `/src/services/excelExport.ts`, `/src/types/index.ts`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/components/WorkTable.tsx`, `/src/components/AddWorkModal.tsx`, `/src/components/ProjectManagementModal.tsx`.\n- **Completed Code Edits**:\n  1. **Updated `/src/data/uscCatalog.ts`**:\n     - Upgraded `USC_CATALOG_VERSION` to `\'3.0.0-USC-FULL\'`.\n     - Restored the complete 84-item USC work catalog (`CATALOG_WORK_ITEMS` and `USC_STANDARD_TEMPLATE`) covering all sections from `RAB Gedung USC.xlsx` (`katalog_volume_usc_639e973f.json`):\n       - **I. Pekerjaan Persiapan & Umum** (`prep-pembersihan-lahan`, `prep-pagar-sementara`, `prep-bouwplank`, `prep-gudang-alat`)\n       - **II. Pekerjaan Struktural - Tanah & Urugan** (`str-galian-tanah-biasa-1m`, `str-galian-pondasi-footplat`, `str-galian-tanah-3m-footplat-a`, `str-urugan-kembali-tanah`, `str-urugan-kembali-footplat`, `str-urugan-tanah-peninggian`, `str-urugan-pasir-bawah-pondasi`, `str-urugan-pasir-bawah-lantai`)\n       - **III. Pekerjaan Struktural - Pondasi** (`str-pasangan-batu-belah-1sp6pp`, `str-pasangan-batu-belah-type-b`, `str-pondasi-footplat-beton`, `str-pondasi-footplat-tulangan`, `str-pondasi-footplat-bekisting`, `str-pondasi-footplat-f2-beton`, `str-pondasi-footplat-f2-tulangan`, `str-pondasi-footplat-f2-bekisting`, `str-lantai-kerja-pondasi`)\n       - **IV. Pekerjaan Struktural - Kolom Pedestal & Sloof** (`str-kolom-pedestal-k1-beton`, `str-kolom-pedestal-k1-tulangan`, `str-kolom-pedestal-k1-begel`, `str-kolom-pedestal-k1-bekisting`, `str-kolom-pedestal-k2-beton`, `str-kolom-pedestal-k2-tulangan`, `str-kolom-pedestal-k2-begel`, `str-kolom-pedestal-k2-bekisting`, `str-sloof-beton`, `str-sloof-s2`, `str-sloof-s3`, `str-sloof-kustom`, `str-sloof-tulangan`, `str-sloof-begel`, `str-sloof-bekisting`)\n       - **V. Pekerjaan Struktural - Kolom Per Lantai** (`str-kolom-k1-beton`, `str-kolom-k1-tulangan`, `str-kolom-k1-begel`, `str-kolom-k1-bekisting`, `str-kolom-k2-beton`, `str-kolom-k2-tulangan`, `str-kolom-k2-begel`, `str-kolom-k2-bekisting`, `str-kolom-k3-beton`, `str-kolom-praktis`, `str-kolom-kustom`)\n       - **VI. Pekerjaan Struktural - Balok Per Lantai** (`str-balok-b1-beton`, `str-balok-b1-tulangan`, `str-balok-b1-begel`, `str-balok-b1-bekisting`, `str-balok-b2-beton`, `str-balok-b2-tulangan`, `str-balok-b2-begel`, `str-balok-b2-bekisting`, `str-balok-b3-beton`, `str-balok-latei`, `str-balok-latei-tulangan`, `str-balok-latei-bekisting`, `str-balok-bordes`, `str-balok-bordes-tulangan`, `str-balok-bordes-bekisting`, `str-balok-induk`, `str-balok-anak`, `str-ring-balok`, `str-balok-kustom`)\n       - **VII. Pekerjaan Struktural - Pelat, Tangga, Atap** (`str-pelat-lantai-beton`, `str-pelat-lantai-tulangan`, `str-pelat-lantai-bekisting`, `str-plat-tangga-beton`, `str-tangga-beton`, `str-tangga-tulangan`, `str-tangga-bekisting`, `str-atap-baja-ringan`, `str-atap-penutup-alderon`, `str-atap-lisplank-grc`)\n       - **VIII. Pekerjaan Arsitektural** (`ars-dinding-bata-hebel`, `ars-plesteran-acian-15mm`, `ars-acian-dinding`, `ars-keramik-dinding-toilet`, `ars-bata-rooster`, `ars-panel-finishing-dinding`, `ars-granit-lantai-60x60`, `ars-homogenous-tile-60x60`, `ars-keramik-toilet-antislip`, `ars-keramik-tangga`, `ars-lantai-beton-acian`, `ars-pengecatan-dinding-eksterior`, `ars-pengecatan-dinding-interior`, `ars-pengecatan-plafond`, `ars-plafond-gypsum`, `ars-list-gypsum`, `ars-pintu-p1-lengkap`, `ars-pintu-p2-lengkap`, `ars-pintu-p3-lengkap`, `ars-pintu-p4-lengkap`, `ars-jendela-j1-lengkap`, `ars-jendela-j2-lengkap`, `ars-jendela-j3-lengkap`, `ars-jendela-j4-lengkap`, `ars-bouvenlight-lengkap`, `ars-fasad-acp-grc`, `ars-railing-tangga`, `ars-landscape-rumput`)\n       - **IX. Pekerjaan MEP** (`mep-titik-lampu`, `mep-stop-kontak`, `mep-saklar-lampu`, `mep-sanitasi-kloset`, `mep-sanitasi-wastafel`, `mep-sanitasi-kran-air`, `mep-pipa-pvc-air-bersih`, `mep-pipa-pvc-air-kotor-4in`, `mep-septic-tank-biotank`, `mep-bak-kontrol`)\n     - Cleared every parameter\'s initial `value` to `null` and `verificationStatus` to `\'Belum Diisi\'`.\n  2. **Updated `/src/services/projectStorage.ts`**:\n     - Derived `DEFAULT_UMUM_PONDASI_CATALOG_IDS`, `DEFAULT_LANTAI_1_CATALOG_IDS`, and `DEFAULT_LANTAI_ATAS_CATALOG_IDS` dynamically from the full `USC_STANDARD_TEMPLATE`.\n     - Added `getGlobalUscTemplate()` returning a deep-cloned read-only copy of `USC_STANDARD_TEMPLATE`.\n     - Updated `createProjectWorkFromCatalog` and `createDefaultWorksForFloor` so every newly created project work has `value: null` on all parameters, `calculatedVolume: null`, `status: \'Belum Diisi\'`, and no old verification status.\n     - Implemented `migrateProjectToFullUscTemplate(project, userId)` and wired it into `loadAllProjects` and `fetchProjectsFromFirestore` so existing user projects (and any legacy custom works) are preserved while automatically restoring any missing USC standard template works per floor.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **Root Cause of the Issue Reported by User**:\n  1. Previously, `/src/services/projectStorage.ts` used three hardcoded small arrays (`DEFAULT_UMUM_PONDASI_CATALOG_IDS` with 17 items, `DEFAULT_LANTAI_1_CATALOG_IDS` with 21 items, `DEFAULT_LANTAI_ATAS_CATALOG_IDS` with 22 items) instead of the full USC catalog, omitting dozens of USC works.\n  2. In `loadAllProjects`, legacy migration previously filtered out `proj-gedung-usc` (`p.id !== \'proj-gedung-usc\'`) and only populated default works if `projectWorks.length === 0`. Consequently, if a user had an existing project like `\"Rumah 2 lantai\"` that already contained a few user-created works (or the simple Lantai 2 template), `projectWorks.length === 0` was false, so the USC template works were never added to their project.\n- **Reference Source Found in Workspace**:\n  - `/public/assets/aistudio/katalog_volume_usc_639e973f.json` contains the full conversion of `RAB Gedung USC.xlsx` (`Volume Persiapan Dll`, `Volume Struktural`, `Volume Arsitektural`), which allowed restoring all 84 authentic USC work items and formulas without fabricating any items.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- `git log -n 10 --stat` returned `fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git`. Resolved by inspecting `/public/assets/aistudio/katalog_volume_usc_639e973f.json` and `/public/assets/aistudio/panduan_integrasi_volume_usc_8fc32daf.md` directly.\n- No build or lint errors encountered so far; verification of the newly edited files is the immediate next step.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- `/src/data/uscCatalog.ts` and `/src/services/projectStorage.ts` have been updated.\n- Check `/src/App.tsx` lines 357\342\200\223384 (`handleRestoreStandardFloorWorks`) and line 575 (`handleAddFloor`) to ensure `createDefaultWorksForFloor` calls pass `activeProject.floorCount` if needed (it defaults to `totalFloors: number = 2`, which works, and passing `activeProject.floorCount` makes it even more accurate).\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Verify & Polish `/src/App.tsx` (if needed)**:\n   - Check `handleRestoreStandardFloorWorks` and `handleAddFloor` in `/src/App.tsx` to pass `activeProject.floorCount` into `createDefaultWorksForFloor`.\n2. **Run 10-Point Verification Script (`## 7. PENGUJIAN`)**:\n   - Run a `npx tsx -e` verification script via `run_command` to verify all 10 items from `## 7. PENGUJIAN`:\n     1. Template standar menggunakan katalog pekerjaan USC lengkap (84 items across Umum & Pondasi, Lantai 1, Lantai 2, Lantai lainnya, Persiapan, Struktural, Arsitektural, MEP).\n     2. Semua kelompok lantai dan pekerjaan USC tampil kembali.\n     3. Seluruh dimensi dan volume proyek baru kosong (`value === null`, `calculatedVolume === null`).\n     4. Semua pekerjaan proyek baru berstatus `Belum Diisi`.\n     5. Rumus asli katalog USC tetap berfungsi (mengisi parameter menghitung volume secara deterministik dan mengubah status ke `Terverifikasi`).\n     6. Proyek yang dibuat pengguna tidak hilang saat migrasi (`migrateProjectToFullUscTemplate`).\n     7. Pekerjaan kustom yang dibuat pengguna tidak hilang saat migrasi.\n     8. Membuat `Proyek A` dan `Proyek B` menghasilkan daftar pekerjaan USC kosong yang terpisah.\n     9. Mengubah atau menghapus pekerjaan di `Proyek A` tidak memengaruhi `Proyek B` atau template global (`getGlobalUscTemplate()`).\n     10. Asisten AI dan input manual tetap berfungsi dengan daftar pekerjaan USC (`applyAutoQuantityTakeoff`).\n3. **Compile & Lint Verification**:\n   - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to ensure zero TypeScript or build errors.\n4. **Provide Final Summary**:\n   - Present a clear, concise summary in Indonesian confirming the restoration of the full USC work template, clearing of all USC demo values, preservation of user projects/custom works, and test results.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Never fabricate fake USC catalog items; all 84 items in `/src/data/uscCatalog.ts` come from the authentic USC reference (`katalog_volume_usc_639e973f.json` / `uscCatalog.ts`).\n- Never delete user projects or custom works.\n- Ensure zero demonstration values (`null` parameters, `null` volume, status `Belum Diisi`) on new projects.\n</summary>"
