      full: "=== VERIFIKASI 10 POIN PENGUJIAN RUANGESTIMASI ===Catalog Version: 3.0.0-USC-FULLTotal USC Catalog Items: 1141. Kategori dalam Template USC: [ \'Persiapan Dll\', \'Struktural\', \'Arsitektural\', \'MEP\' ]2. Kelompok Lantai & Jumlah Pekerjaan Standar USC: [  { floor: \'Umum & Pondasi\', count: 39 },  { floor: \'Lantai 1\', count: 72 },  { floor: \'Lantai 2\', count: 75 },  { floor: \'Lantai 3\', count: 75 }]3. Ada parameter berisi nilai demo USC? false | Ada volume terisi? false4. Semua pekerjaan proyek baru berstatus Belum Diisi? true5. Uji Rumus Asli USC (Kolom K1 0.4x0.4x4.0 x 10 bh): { volume: 160, status: \'Terverifikasi\' }[eval]:43  throw new Error(\"Test 5 gagal: Rumus asli USC tidak berfungsi sebagaimana mestinya\");  ^Error: Test 5 gagal: Rumus asli USC tidak berfungsi sebagaimana mestinya    at [eval]:43:9    at runScriptInThisContext (node:internal/vm:209:10)    at node:internal/process/execution:446:12    at [eval]-wrapper:6:24    at runScriptInContext (node:internal/process/execution:444:60)    at evalFunction (node:internal/process/execution:279:30)    at asyncRunEntryPointWithESMLoader (node:internal/modules/run_main:117:11)Node.js v22.23.3"
