      text: "Apply the edits shown in the screenshot.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nMedia attachment: User sent attachment: /assets/aistudio/screenshot_1_dbf5a5c7.png (saved in workspace at /public/assets/aistudio/screenshot_1_dbf5a5c7.png). Read it with view_file at that path; in shell commands, which run from the workspace root, use the relative path public/assets/aistudio/screenshot_1_dbf5a5c7.png. When displaying or embedding this asset in code, reference this local file path directly. Only invoke image generation tools if the user explicitly requests creating or modifying an image.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
