    thinking: "**Expanding Drawing Types**\n\nI\'m currently working on systematically expanding the `EngineeringDrawingType` in `/src/types/index.ts`. The goal is to comprehensively support all sixteen drawing classifications while maintaining backward compatibility with existing aliases. This means carefully planning and implementing new types, ensuring they\'re clearly defined and integrated without disrupting existing code. I\'m focusing on clean, well-documented changes.\n\n\n**Refining Drawing Categories**\n\nI\'ve been refining the drawing category types. My focus shifted to adding specific Indonesian architectural and structural drawing types, like \"Denah Arsitektur\" and \"Denah Struktur.\" I\'m also incorporating types for foundation, column, and other structural details. Furthermore, I\'ve defined new types for AI verification badges and AI extraction errors to handle various scenarios, including readability and processing issues. I\'m keen on a robust and complete system.\n\n\n**Implementing Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now focused on enhancing several key data structures. I\'m adding `drawingTitle`, `identifiedFloor`, `gridLocation`, `verificationBadge`, and `sourceInfo` to `ParameterItem` and `AIExtractionItem`. In addition, I am adding `isolationVersion` and `aiTakeoffHistory` to the `ProjectData` type, so each project will store its AI analysis history, tied to its owner. This will provide more detailed context and traceability.\n\n\n**Developing API Endpoints**\n\nI\'m currently developing API endpoints for project management and AI dimension extraction. Specifically, I\'m working on GET, POST, and DELETE endpoints for projects, ensuring that each endpoint validates the user\'s ID to prevent unauthorized access and data manipulation. The DELETE endpoint, in particular, will rigorously check ownership before deletion, returning a 403 error for unauthorized attempts. I\'m also optimizing the `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` endpoint, focusing on comprehensive input validation.\n\n\n**Caching Extraction Results**\n\nI\'m now implementing a robust caching strategy for AI dimension extraction to avoid redundant processing. The approach involves calculating a document hash based on user ID, project ID, target floor ID, unit and scale settings, page selection, and the base64-encoded file. If a cache hit occurs for an identical request, I\'ll return the result immediately, enhancing efficiency and preventing unnecessary reprocessing. I\'ve also updated the Gemini system instruction and schema for improved document classification across sixteen canonical drawing types.\n\n\n**Implementing Structural Integrity**\n\nI\'m now focusing on ensuring structural integrity in data extraction. I\'m developing logic to prevent mixing architectural plan numbers with structural sections unless element identities match, crucial for maintaining data accuracy. I am also calculating the total length of beams and sloofs from grid segments and matching structural schedules with plan element codes, guaranteeing clear data validation rules for cross-section dimensions and lengths. I\'m also implementing the required badges and source information for validation. Moreover, I\'m updating the Firestore rules to permit optional fields. Finally, I will be eliminating demo data.\n\n\n**Preventing Data Leakage**\n\nI\'m now implementing robust measures to prevent cross-account data leakage. I\'ve introduced `DATA_ISOLATION_VERSION` and permanently removed the legacy storage key fallback, ensuring unowned legacy data cannot contaminate any user account. I\'m also scoping custom catalog items and disabled catalog IDs by user ID. I\'m meticulously sanitizing any projects with conflicting owner UIDs or leaked demo data from pre-isolation versions. This includes stripping specific demo values and references to guarantee data integrity and user data isolation.\n\n\n**Refining Auto-Takeoff**\n\nI\'m currently enhancing the `applyAutoQuantityTakeoff` function specifically for Section 3D, 3E, 3F, and 3G. I\'m focusing on deduplicating segments by element code, grid location, and segment name on the same floor to prevent double-counting at grid intersections, while grouping segments strictly by element code to avoid mixing. Furthermore, I\'m now stamping each AI-populated parameter with `sourceInfo` and `verificationBadge` to improve traceability and validate merged data. This prevents demo data leaks.\n\n\n\n**Implementing Verification Rules**\n\nI am now implementing new AI verification rules and table enhancements. I\'m setting `aiVerificationStatus` to `\'Terbaca Jelas\'` if confidence is >= 0.85, `\'Perlu Verifikasi\'` if it\'s lower or a conflict exists, and `\'Tidak Ditemukan\'` if required parameters remain null. I\'ve also added category drawers to the work table. Works on each floor are grouped into collapsible category drawers in USC order: `Persiapan Dll`, `Struktural`, `Arsitektural`, `MEP`. I am tracking the open/close state of the drawers using `openCategories`.\n\n\n**Enhancing User Interface**\n\nI\'m now implementing the new UI enhancements for floor-specific accordion drawers. I\'ve ensured independent state management for each category (Structural, Architectural, etc.) using `${floorId}::${category}` to track open/close status. I\'m focusing on adding rich summary badges to category headers, including counts for \"Belum Diisi\" and filled/verified works. Also, I am adding \"Show All\" and \"Minimalis\" buttons to manage visibility across floors. I\'m working on integrating these features into the table toolbar.\n\n\n**Integrating Modal States**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial modal state management across the application. I\'m keying `AIAssistantModal` and `WorkDetailModal` by `${userId}-${activeProject.id}` in `App.tsx` for clean project and user switching, preventing stale AI extractions. I am focusing on detailed, 4-stage reading progress indicators within the `AIAssistantModal`. I\'m implementing UI display of 16 drawing types, page numbers, titles, and codes.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_541743"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"/**\\n * RuangEstimasi - Type Definitions\\n * Platform AI Quantity Takeoff untuk membantu membaca gambar teknik, menghitung volume pekerjaan konstruksi, dan mengelola estimasi kuantitas proyek.\\n */\\n\\nexport type WorkCategory = \'Persiapan Dll\' | \'Struktural\' | \'Arsitektural\' | \'MEP\';\\n\\nexport type UserAccountType = \'Student\' | \'Estimator\' | \'Other\';\\n\\nexport interface UserProfile {\\n  uid: string;\\n  fullName: string;\\n  email: string;\\n  userType: UserAccountType;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  authProvider?: \'email\' | \'google\';\\n}\\n\\nexport type CalculationStatus =\\n  | \'Terverifikasi\'\\n  | \'Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n  | \'Tidak Lengkap\'\\n  | \'Belum Diisi\'\\n  | \'Lengkap\'\\n  | \'Belum Lengkap\'\\n  | \'Perlu Input\'\\n  | \'Draf AI \342\200\224 Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n  | \'Rumus Perlu Dikonfigurasi\'\\n  | \'Rumus Belum Dipetakan\'\\n  | \'Kesalahan Perhitungan\'\\n  | \'Tidak Digunakan\';\\n\\nexport type AIVerificationBadge =\\n  | \'Terbaca Jelas\'\\n  | \'Hasil Penggabungan\'\\n  | \'Perlu Verifikasi\'\\n  | \'Tidak Ditemukan\';\\n\\nexport type AIExtractionErrorType =\\n  | \'api_error\'\\n  | \'unreadable_file\'\\n  | \'unsupported_format\'\\n  | \'incomplete_extraction\';\\n\\nexport type ParameterType = \'number\' | \'text\' | \'select\';\\n\\nexport type DrawingUnit = \'mm\' | \'cm\' | \'m\';\\n\\nexport type DrawingScale =\\n  | \'1:20\'\\n  | \'1:50\'\\n  | \'1:75\'\\n  | \'1:100\'\\n  | \'1:150\'\\n  | \'1:200\'\\n  | \'custom\'\\n  | \'unknown\';\\n\\n/**\\n * 16 Klasifikasi Standar Halaman / Bagian Gambar Teknik RuangEstimasi\\n * (beserta dukungan alias untuk kompatibilitas mundur)\\n */\\nexport type EngineeringDrawingType =\\n  | \'Denah arsitektur\'\\n  | \'Denah struktur\'\\n  | \'Denah pondasi\'\\n  | \'Denah kolom\'\\n  | \'Denah balok\'\\n  | \'Denah sloof\'\\n  | \'Denah pembesian\'\\n  | \'Gambar potongan\'\\n  | \'Gambar tampak\'\\n  | \'Detail konstruksi\'\\n  | \'Detail penulangan\'\\n  | \'Tabel dimensi atau schedule\'\\n  | \'Gambar tangga\'\\n  | \'Gambar atap\'\\n  | \'Gambar MEP\'\\n  | \'Tidak diketahui / perlu pemeriksaan manual\'\\n  | \'Denah Arsitektur\'\\n  | \'Denah Struktur\'\\n  | \'Denah Kolom\'\\n  | \'Denah Balok\'\\n  | \'Denah Sloof\'\\n  | \'Denah Pondasi\'\\n  | \'Potongan Bangunan\'\\n  | \'Tampak Bangunan\'\\n  | \'Detail Tangga\'\\n  | \'Detail Pondasi\'\\n  | \'Detail Sambungan\'\\n  | \'Detail Penulangan\'\\n  | \'Tabel Dimensi dan Penulangan\'\\n  | \'Detail Konstruksi Lainnya\';\\n\\nexport const CANONICAL_DRAWING_TYPES: string[] = [\\n  \'Denah arsitektur\',\\n  \'Denah struktur\',\\n  \'Denah pondasi\',\\n  \'Denah kolom\',\\n  \'Denah balok\',\\n  \'Denah sloof\',\\n  \'Denah pembesian\',\\n  \'Gambar potongan\',\\n  \'Gambar tampak\',\\n  \'Detail konstruksi\',\\n  \'Detail penulangan\',\\n  \'Tabel dimensi atau schedule\',\\n  \'Gambar tangga\',\\n  \'Gambar atap\',\\n  \'Gambar MEP\',\\n  \'Tidak diketahui / perlu pemeriksaan manual\',\\n];\\n\\nexport interface AIDetectedRegion {\\n  pageNumber: number;\\n  drawingType: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n  title: string;\\n  identifiedFloor?: string;\\n  scale?: string;\\n  summary: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIBeamSloofSegment {\\n  id: string;\\n  elementCode: string; // Contoh: \\\"S1\\\", \\\"S2\\\", \\\"B1\\\", \\\"B2\\\"\\n  elementCategory: \'sloof\' | \'balok\';\\n  segmentName: string; // Contoh: \\\"Segmen A\342\200\223B\\\"\\n  gridLocation: string; // Contoh: \\\"As A\342\200\223B / Grid 1\\\"\\n  rawLength: number; // Nilai tertulis pada gambar (misal 300 cm atau 3.00 m)\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit;\\n  lengthMeters: number; // Panjang 1 segmen dalam meter (m)\\n  count: number; // Jumlah segmen identik pada jalur tersebut\\n  subtotalMeters: number; // lengthMeters * count\\n  pageNumber?: number;\\n  drawingType?: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n  drawingTitle?: string;\\n  identifiedFloor?: string;\\n  sourceInfo?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParameterConflict {\\n  newValue: number;\\n  rawExtractedValue: number;\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit;\\n  sourceDocument: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n  sourceInfo?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ParameterItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  label: string;\\n  placeholder?: string;\\n  value: number | string | null;\\n  unit: string;\\n  type?: ParameterType;\\n  required?: boolean;\\n  source?: \'manual\' | \'ai\' | \'derived\' | \'reference\';\\n  sourceDocument?: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n  sourceInfo?: string; // Contoh: \\\"Halaman 4, Denah Balok Lantai 1\\\"\\n  drawingType?: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n  drawingTitle?: string;\\n  identifiedFloor?: string;\\n  gridLocation?: string;\\n  elementCode?: string;\\n  pageNumber?: number;\\n  rawExtractedValue?: number;\\n  rawUnit?: DrawingUnit;\\n  verificationBadge?: AIVerificationBadge;\\n  isVerified?: boolean;\\n  conflict?: ParameterConflict | null;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  excelCellRef?: string; // Metadata internal\\n}\\n\\nexport interface WorkComponent {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  parameters: Record<string, number | null>;\\n  formulaText?: string;\\n  computedVolume?: number | null;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CatalogWorkItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  code?: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  category: WorkCategory;\\n  subCategory?: string;\\n  floorRule: \'umum\' | \'per_lantai\' | \'atap_saja\' | \'fondasi_saja\';\\n  description: string;\\n  defaultUnit: string;\\n  formulaDisplay: string;\\n  customFormula?: string;\\n  isCustomCatalog?: boolean;\\n  excelSheet: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelCell: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelFormula?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  parameters: ParameterItem[];\\n  defaultComponents?: WorkComponent[];\\n  calculationMethod: (params: Record<string, number>, components?: WorkComponent[]) => number | null;\\n  verificationStatus: CalculationStatus;\\n  verificationNotes?: string;\\n  hasExternalRef?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProjectWorkItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  catalogId?: string;\\n  dedupKey?: string; // Kunci stabil pencegahan duplikasi (floorId + catalogId + elementCode)\\n  name: string;\\n  category: WorkCategory;\\n  subCategory?: string;\\n  floorId: string; // \\\"fl-umum\\\" atau floorId\\n  elementLocation?: string; // Lokasi / As / Ruang dari gambar\\n  elementCode?: string; // Kode elemen struktur (misal: S1, B1, K1)\\n  segments?: AIBeamSloofSegment[]; // Rincian segmen jika pekerjaan berupa Balok / Sloof\\n  unit: string;\\n  formulaDisplay: string;\\n  parameters: ParameterItem[];\\n  components: WorkComponent[];\\n  calculatedVolume: number | null;\\n  status: CalculationStatus;\\n  statusMessage?: string;\\n  origin?: \'manual\' | \'ai\';\\n  aiVerificationStatus?: \'draft\' | \'verified\' | \'rejected\';\\n  verificationBadge?: AIVerificationBadge;\\n  sourceDocument?: string;\\n  sourceInfo?: string;\\n  identificationReason?: string;\\n  excelSheet?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelCell?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  excelFormula?: string; // Metadata internal\\n  customFormula?: string;\\n  notes?: string;\\n  isActive: boolean;\\n  lastUpdated?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface FloorItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string; // e.g. \\\"Lantai 1\\\", \\\"Lantai 2\\\", \\\"Umum & Pondasi\\\"\\n  level: number;\\n  elevation?: string;\\n  description?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AITakeoffHistoryRecord {\\n  documentHash: string;\\n  fileName: string;\\n  analyzedAt: string;\\n  targetFloorId: string;\\n  summary: AIAutoTakeoffSummary;\\n  extractions: AIExtractionItem[];\\n  detectedRegions: AIDetectedRegion[];\\n  segments: AIBeamSloofSegment[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface ProjectData {\\n  id: string;\\n  ownerUid?: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  location?: string;\\n  description?: string;\\n  createdAt: string;\\n  updatedAt: string;\\n  floorCount: number;\\n  floors: FloorItem[];\\n  works: ProjectWorkItem[];\\n  rejectedDraftKeys?: string[];\\n  catalogVersion: string;\\n  isolationVersion?: string;\\n  aiTakeoffHistory?: AITakeoffHistoryRecord[];\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIExtractionItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  targetCategory: string;\\n  suggestedWorkName: string;\\n  elementCode?: string; // Kode elemen pada gambar (S1, B1, K1, P1, J1, dll)\\n  drawingType?: EngineeringDrawingType;\\n  drawingTitle?: string;\\n  identifiedFloor?: string;\\n  gridLocation?: string;\\n  pageNumber?: number;\\n  catalogId?: string;\\n  parameterId?: string;\\n  parameterName: string;\\n  rawExtractedValue: number;\\n  rawUnit: DrawingUnit;\\n  explicitUnitOnDrawing?: string;\\n  convertedValue: number;\\n  convertedUnit: string;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  verificationBadge?: AIVerificationBadge;\\n  sourceDocument: string;\\n  pageOrLocation?: string;\\n  sourceInfo?: string; // Contoh: \\\"Halaman 4, Denah Balok Lantai 1\\\"\\n  notes?: string;\\n  userCorrection?: number;\\n  status: \'pending\' | \'approved\' | \'rejected\' | \'applied\';\\n  targetWorkId?: string;\\n  targetParamId?: string;\\n  isRecommendationOnly?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface AIAutoTakeoffSummary {\\n  documentSummary: string;\\n  drawingType: \'arsitektur_denah\' | \'struktur_denah\' | \'potongan_detail\' | \'lainnya\';\\n  detectedRegions?: AIDetectedRegion[];\\n  segments?: AIBeamSloofSegment[];\\n  identifiedFloor: string;\\n  identifiedScale: string;\\n  extractedCount: number;\\n  createdDraftWorksCount: number;\\n  updatedExistingWorksCount: number;\\n  incompleteWorksCount: number;\\n  conflictCount: number;\\n  fromCache?: boolean;\\n  recommendations: {\\n    catalogId: string;\\n    name: string;\\n    category: WorkCategory;\\n    reason: string;\\n  }[];\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Update types in src/types/index.ts to support 16 drawing classifications, AI verification badges, source metadata, error types, and project data isolation\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/types/index.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating src/types/index.ts\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update src/types/index.ts\"}"
