  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 9
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **Core Request**: Apply the \"MASTER PROMPT PERBAIKAN \342\200\224 RUANGESTIMASI: Isolasi Data Pengguna, Tampilan Kategori Pekerjaan, dan Optimalisasi AI Quantity Takeoff\" to the existing **RuangEstimasi** application without rebuilding from scratch or removing existing features.\n   - **Three Primary Deliverables**:\n     1. **Perbaikan Data Demo dan Isolasi Antarakun (Section 1)**:\n        - Audit all storage sources and eliminate legacy/demo values (`12.7` m panjang lahan, `6` m lebar lahan, `76.20` m\302\262 volume pembersihan lahan, `37.40` m panjang bouwplank, and stale AI extraction results from `rencana 1-Model.pdf` / `Gedung USC A4-16.pdf`).\n        - Enforce strict per-user (`userId`) and per-project (`projectId`) isolation across client storage, backend API (`/api/projects`), and Cloud Firestore (`firestore.rules`).\n        - Ensure Account A cannot read, modify, or delete Account B\'s data.\n        - Separate read-only global `USC_STANDARD_TEMPLATE` from `USER_PROJECT_DATA`.\n     2. **Sistem Kategori Pekerjaan Seperti Laci / Accordion (Section 2)**:\n        - Within each floor group (`Umum & Pondasi`, `Lantai 1`, `Lantai 2`, etc.), group works into collapsible category drawers (`Persiapan Dll`, `Struktural`, `Arsitektural`, `MEP`).\n        - Clicking a category opens/closes ONLY that category on that floor (`\342\226\266 Kategori (N pekerjaan)` when closed, `\342\226\274 Kategori (N pekerjaan)` when open), displaying unfilled/filled/AI-verification counts.\n        - Track open/close state independently per floor (`${floorId}::${category}`), persisted per `(userId, projectId)`.\n        - Provide **Show All** (opens all categories on viewed floor) and **Minimalis** (closes all categories on viewed floor) buttons both in the top toolbar and in each floor\'s header bar.\n     3. **Optimalisasi Asisten AI Quantity Takeoff (Section 3)**:\n        - Classify pages/regions into the 16 required drawing types (`Denah arsitektur`, `Denah struktur`, `Denah pondasi`, `Denah kolom`, `Denah balok`, `Denah sloof`, `Denah pembesian`, `Gambar potongan`, `Gambar tampak`, `Detail konstruksi`, `Detail penulangan`, `Tabel dimensi atau schedule`, `Gambar tangga`, `Gambar atap`, `Gambar MEP`, `Tidak diketahui / perlu pemeriksaan manual`).\n        - Record `pageNumber`, `drawingType`, `drawingTitle`, `identifiedFloor`, `gridLocation`, `elementCode`, `sourceInfo`, and `verificationBadge` (`Terbaca Jelas`, `Hasil Penggabungan`, `Perlu Verifikasi`, `Tidak Ditemukan`).\n        - Calculate beam (`B1`, `B2`, etc.) and sloof (`S1`, `S2`, etc.) total length from grid segment summation (`Segmen A\342\200\223B: 3,00 m`, etc.), deduplicating intersections and never using building perimeter.\n        - Match structural schedules/tables with plan element codes (`K1`, `B1`, `S1`) without mixing `B2` into `B1`.\n        - Map AI findings to existing USC standard works first; never auto-mark AI results as `Terverifikasi`; allow user to edit, approve (`Setujui`), or reject (`Tolak`).\n        - Add SHA-256 document hash caching scoped to `(userId, projectId)` in `/server.ts`, staged progress indicators, and 4 distinct error classifications (`api_error`, `unreadable_file`, `unsupported_format`, `incomplete_extraction`).\n   - **Target Metadata**:\n     - Applet ID: `fe31a1d6-62db-405b-8277-2f5da668fc00`\n     - User Email: `muh.bima.adjie@gmail.com`\n     - Firestore DB: `ai-studio-ruangrabaiquanti-fe31a1d6-62db-405b-8277-2f5da668fc00`\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Skills & References Read**:\n     - `/skills/system_skills/firebase-integration-rpc/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n     - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/3_saas_dashboard.md`\n   - **Codebase Audit & Edits Completed**:\n     1. `/src/types/index.ts` \342\200\224 Updated with 16 canonical `EngineeringDrawingType` values, `CANONICAL_DRAWING_TYPES`, `AIVerificationBadge`, `AIExtractionErrorType`, `AITakeoffHistoryRecord`, `sourceInfo`, `drawingTitle`, `identifiedFloor`, `gridLocation`, and `isolationVersion`.\n     2. `/server.ts` \342\200\224 Updated with:\n        - Per-user isolated project persistence in `/data/projects_store.json` (`GET /api/projects`, `POST /api/projects/sync`, `PUT /api/projects/:projectId`, `DELETE /api/projects/:projectId`) enforcing `ownerUid === userId` (returning HTTP 403 Forbidden if Account A attempts to modify/delete Account B\'s project).\n        - Per-user & per-project AI extraction cache in `/data/ai_cache_store.json` keyed by `${userId}::${projectId}::${documentHash}`.\n        - Upgraded `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` with 16 drawing classifications, segment summation instructions, schedule matching, `verificationBadge`, `sourceInfo`, and `errorType` differentiation.\n     3. `/firestore.rules` \342\200\224 Updated to allow optional `isolationVersion` and `aiTakeoffHistory` on `/users/{userId}/projects/{projectId}` while enforcing `isOwner(userId)`.\n     4. `/src/services/projectStorage.ts` \342\200\224 Updated with `DATA_ISOLATION_VERSION = \'4.0.0-ISOLATED\'`, removal of unowned `LEGACY_STORAGE_KEY_PROJECTS` (`ruangrab_projects_v1`) fallback, automatic cleanup of leaked demo values (`12.7`, `6`, `76.20`, `37.40`, `rencana 1-Model`, `Gedung USC`), per-user scoping of custom catalog items, backend `/api/projects` sync helpers, segment deduplication, and `verificationBadge` + `sourceInfo` assignment in `applyAutoQuantityTakeoff`.\n     5. `/src/components/WorkTable.tsx` \342\200\224 Updated with independent Category Accordion drawers per floor (`${floorId}::${category}`), `\342\226\266` / `\342\226\274` drawer indicators, work count & `Belum Diisi` / `Terisi` / `Perlu Verifikasi AI` badges, floor selector bar, and **Show All** + **Minimalis** buttons in both the main toolbar and each floor header.\n     6. `/src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx` \342\200\224 Updated with 16 drawing type classifications, 4-step reading progress indicator, element-grouped segment breakdown tables (`Total Panjang B1 = ...`), `sourceInfo` & `verificationBadge` pills, individual `Terima`/`Tolak` buttons, and `errorType` messages.\n     7. `/src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx` \342\200\224 Updated with `verificationBadge` pills, `sourceInfo` display, and `Tolak Usulan AI` button.\n     8. `/src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Updated to sync with `/api/projects`, key modals/tables by `${userId}-${activeProject.id}`, reset transient state on account switch/logout, and support `handleRejectDraftWork`.\n   - **Pending Verification**:\n     - Run `compile_applet`, `lint_applet`, `restart_dev_server`, and verify all endpoints and automated checks.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - **Root Cause of Demo Data Leak Across Accounts**:\n     - Previously, `loadAllProjects(userId)` in `/src/services/projectStorage.ts` had a fallback that read `localStorage.getItem(\'ruangrab_projects_v1\')` (an unowned legacy storage key from before user authentication existed) and copied `legacyUserProjects` into every account that logged in. That legacy project contained the extraction from `rencana 1-Model.pdf` (`panjang = 12.7` m, `lebar = 6` m, `volume pembersihan lahan = 76.20` m\302\262, `panjang bouwplank = 37.40` m).\n     - By removing `LEGACY_STORAGE_KEY_PROJECTS` migration, purging `ruangrab_projects_v1`, bumping `DATA_ISOLATION_VERSION = \'4.0.0-ISOLATED\'`, stripping pre-isolation demo values (`12.7`, `6`, `76.20`, `37.40`), and enforcing `ownerUid === userId` on both client and `/api/projects` server storage, cross-account leakage and demo values are completely eliminated.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **Transient `view_file` Timeout**: Earlier in the turn, reading two large files simultaneously timed out; resolved by reading smaller line ranges.\n   - **Dev Server Cold-Start**: Previously fixed in `/server.ts` by binding `app.listen(PORT, \'0.0.0.0\')` immediately while `createViteServer` initializes asynchronously. Kept this exact pattern in the updated `/server.ts`.\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - All code edits across `/src/types/index.ts`, `/server.ts`, `/firestore.rules`, `/src/services/projectStorage.ts`, `/src/components/WorkTable.tsx`, `/src/components/AIAssistantModal.tsx`, `/src/components/WorkDetailModal.tsx`, and `/src/App.tsx` are complete.\n   - Check if `/src/components/AddWorkModal.tsx` needs any minor adjustment for `userId` in `loadCustomCatalogItems` / `saveCustomCatalogItems` (they have optional `userId?: string` defaulting to `resolveActiveUserId()`, so existing calls without args remain 100% compatible).\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. **Compile, Lint, and Restart Dev Server**:\n      - Call `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` to verify zero TypeScript or build errors.\n      - Call `restart_dev_server` so the new `/api/projects` and `/api/gemini/extract-dimensions` routes in `/server.ts` are live.\n      - Deploy updated `firestore.rules` using `rpc_action` (`service_name: \"firebase\"`, `method_name: \"DeployRules\"`, `arguments: { rules_Types: [\"FIRESTORE\"] }`) or `deploy_firebase`.\n   2. **Run Mandatory End-to-End Verification**:\n      - Test 1 (Isolasi Akun & Proyek Baru Bersih): Register/login Account A and Account B via `/api/auth/register`, verify new projects have all 114 USC works with `value: null`, `calculatedVolume: null`, `status: \'Belum Diisi\'`, zero `12.7` / `6` / `76.20` / `37.40` values, and verify Account B cannot read, update, or delete Account A\'s project on `/api/projects` (returns 403 Forbidden) or in client storage.\n      - Test 2 (Sistem Kategori Accordion Independen): Verify floor grouping (`Umum & Pondasi`, `Lantai 1`, `Lantai 2`), independent category drawer toggling (`Persiapan Dll`, `Struktural`, `Arsitektural`, `MEP`), `Show All`, and `Minimalis`.\n      - Test 3 (AI Quantity Takeoff): Verify 16 drawing type classifications, beam (`B1`: 3.00 + 4.00 + 3.50 = 10.50 m) & sloof (`S.1`) segment summation + intersection deduplication, schedule matching (`B1` vs `B2` isolation), USC default work linking without duplication, `sourceInfo` & `verificationBadge` (`Terbaca Jelas`, `Hasil Penggabungan`, `Perlu Verifikasi`, `Tidak Ditemukan`), and per-project document hash caching.\n   3. **Deliver Final Report in Indonesian**:\n      - Provide the structured 6-point report requested by the user:\n        1. Sumber data demo/bocor yang ditemukan dan bagaimana dibersihkan.\n        2. Bagaimana isolasi data antarakun dan antarproyek diterapkan.\n        3. Bagaimana sistem kategori accordion, Show All, dan Minimalis bekerja pada setiap lantai.\n        4. Bagaimana alur pembacaan gambar AI diperbaiki untuk berbagai jenis gambar, segmen balok/sloof, dan tabel struktur.\n        5.Bagaimana pencocokan hasil AI ke pekerjaan default USC dilakukan tanpa duplikasi.\n        6. Hasil pengujian untuk memastikan akun berbeda, proyek baru, kategori pekerjaan, dan AI Quantity Takeoff berjalan dengan benar.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - Maintain all existing features (login/register, user profile, multi-project, floor management, full 114-item USC catalog & formulas, manual input, volume calculator, summary & recap cards, Excel export).\n   - Keep all Gemini API calls strictly server-side in `/server.ts`.\n</summary>"
    included_step_index_start: 368
